(864359, 97780, 7038, '<td valign="top">Hmm...interesting photo.  I''m not too crazy about the border on this, and it''s a the extra reflection in the window on the bottom left detracts a bit from the image.  Maybe a polarizer would of helped cut that out?  Overall though, I like the whole feel and atmosphere of the shot.</td>', 'Hmm...interesting photo.  I''m not too crazy about the border on this, and it''s a the extra reflection in the window on the bottom left detracts a bit from the image.  Maybe a polarizer would of helped cut that out?  Overall though, I like the whole feel and atmosphere of the shot.', '2004-08-18 01:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(864360, 98412, 772, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly interesting shot... The lighting is not great for the shot and I can''t really see much of a relation to the challenge topic.  There is a neon sign in the window... sure :)</td>', 'Not a particularly interesting shot... The lighting is not great for the shot and I can''t really see much of a relation to the challenge topic.  There is a neon sign in the window... sure :)', '2004-08-18 01:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
