(864529, 98432, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but I can''t read the entire sign. I think if you include a sign and it''s a major component of your composition, the viewer should be able to see it all. Maybe focus your attention to the lights at the top of the marquee vs the wording of the establishment.</td>', 'Interesting idea but I can''t read the entire sign. I think if you include a sign and it''s a major component of your composition, the viewer should be able to see it all. Maybe focus your attention to the lights at the top of the marquee vs the wording of the establishment.', '2004-08-18 02:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(864531, 97429, 23146, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but I think needs a little bit of focus</td>', 'nice picture, but I think needs a little bit of focus', '2004-08-18 02:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(864532, 98521, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excessively grainy. The subject (the sign) goes right up to the edge in the upper left and very close to it in the lower right. I feel that there shou;d be some space between the subject and the edge as this current composition feels cramped.</td>', 'Excessively grainy. The subject (the sign) goes right up to the edge in the upper left and very close to it in the lower right. I feel that there shou;d be some space between the subject and the edge as this current composition feels cramped.', '2004-08-18 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(864533, 98254, 24976, '<td valign="top">cool, love the softness and the mood... the pattern from the lighting is a great addition</td>', 'cool, love the softness and the mood... the pattern from the lighting is a great addition', '2004-08-18 02:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(864537, 97749, 24976, '<td valign="top">neon? slightly off topic imo<br/>that said i like the grainy film feel it has and interesting composition</td>', 'neon? slightly off topic imothat said i like the grainy film feel it has and interesting composition', '2004-08-18 02:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(864539, 98036, 8054, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to finally see the "DREAMCOAT CAFE" lettering in the lower right and in tiny lettering on top of that. Also, try to make it easier for the viewer to see the relationship between the title and the photo. I personally find that it makes a difference to me if I struggle to see the correlation between the two. Despite the reflections off the glass, it looks like this place might be called Bridgeman''s but I''m guessing. Next time try using a polarizer to eliminate the reflections or try a different angle.</td>', 'Took me a while to finally see the "DREAMCOAT CAFE" lettering in the lower right and in tiny lettering on top of that. Also, try to make it easier for the viewer to see the relationship between the title and the photo. I personally find that it makes a difference to me if I struggle to see the correlation between the two. Despite the reflections off the glass, it looks like this place might be called Bridgeman''s but I''m guessing. Next time try using a polarizer to eliminate the reflections or try a different angle.', '2004-08-18 02:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(864540, 98257, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, capture and composition! but a bit over processed.</td>', 'excellent idea, capture and composition! but a bit over processed.', '2004-08-18 02:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(864541, 98077, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice job at fish photography since this is very difficult to do. Aside from that, I don''t see a very enticing shot. It''s more snapshot-esque and the tail is cut off.</td>', 'Nice job at fish photography since this is very difficult to do. Aside from that, I don''t see a very enticing shot. It''s more snapshot-esque and the tail is cut off.', '2004-08-18 02:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
