(864809, 98266, 24511, '<td valign="top">The out of focus shapes did not appeal to me as I imagine poor news coverage does.  Having to make sense of the absurd is my feeling regarding this image of yours.  Very strange yet neon-like.  Thanks!</td>', 'The out of focus shapes did not appeal to me as I imagine poor news coverage does.  Having to make sense of the absurd is my feeling regarding this image of yours.  Very strange yet neon-like.  Thanks!', '2004-08-18 05:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
