(864837, 98088, 24511, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image but I needed to dig deep to find the neon connection.  The neon lights are very bright on broadway "au contraire" to little miss out in the cold and rain.  As neon pulls our attention toward the flash and glare,  shouldn''t we care for less glitz and more giving?  Thanks!</td>', 'Fantastic image but I needed to dig deep to find the neon connection.  The neon lights are very bright on broadway "au contraire" to little miss out in the cold and rain.  As neon pulls our attention toward the flash and glare,  shouldn''t we care for less glitz and more giving?  Thanks!', '2004-08-18 05:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(864838, 98391, 25017, '<td valign="top">what an original idea! love it!</td>', 'what an original idea! love it!', '2004-08-18 05:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
