(864851, 97756, 24511, '<td valign="top">I wondered if you used a filter to get that neon red sky?  Great photo with excellent lines and the classic three objects to create balance and eye movement around the focal point sun.  Thanks!</td>', 'I wondered if you used a filter to get that neon red sky?  Great photo with excellent lines and the classic three objects to create balance and eye movement around the focal point sun.  Thanks!', '2004-08-18 06:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
