(864858, 97731, 24511, '<td valign="top">I get a musical feeling to this flute or arche crossing my visual path with unexpected notches and shaded spaces.  The background is to me the recital hall where bouncing light and sound mix and tempt my senses.  Very captivating!  Thanks!</td>', 'I get a musical feeling to this flute or arche crossing my visual path with unexpected notches and shaded spaces.  The background is to me the recital hall where bouncing light and sound mix and tempt my senses.  Very captivating!  Thanks!', '2004-08-18 06:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
