(864865, 98268, 145, '<td valign="top">I think an angle that would have shown the whole ''Hollywood'' street sign would have added more to the photo. - 4</td>', 'I think an angle that would have shown the whole ''Hollywood'' street sign would have added more to the photo. - 4', '2004-08-18 06:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
