(864925, 97038, 18644, '<td valign="top">Neon?</td>', 'Neon?', '2004-08-18 07:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(864926, 97508, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice take on an everyday place, lol. I''ll give you an 8...</td>', 'Nice take on an everyday place, lol. I''ll give you an 8...', '2004-08-18 07:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(864931, 97848, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit of a turn-off for me in that to get this much brightness / saturation significant detail was sacrificed in the image.  Just doesn''t feel right to me.</td>', 'A bit of a turn-off for me in that to get this much brightness / saturation significant detail was sacrificed in the image.  Just doesn''t feel right to me.', '2004-08-18 08:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(864932, 98028, 20204, '<td valign="top">The fuzziness of the image is distracting. Perhaps it was handheld and a tripod would have helped?  I do like the composition though.</td>', 'The fuzziness of the image is distracting. Perhaps it was handheld and a tripod would have helped?  I do like the composition though.', '2004-08-18 08:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(864935, 97737, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the reflection in the window.  The tilted image is a bit distracting to me, and I would have liked a more hirozontal format to clip out the awning and emphasize the window and sign.</td>', 'Nice capture of the reflection in the window.  The tilted image is a bit distracting to me, and I would have liked a more hirozontal format to clip out the awning and emphasize the window and sign.', '2004-08-18 08:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(864937, 98107, 20204, '<td valign="top">If this were more sharp it would be a great image to me.  The washed out color and unsharp lines detract significantly.  When composing an image with simpler design elements I think it''s important to have them very clear.  By simple I mean that you have 6 similar springs as opposed to a landscape, or an intricate flower.  Hope this is helpful!</td>', 'If this were more sharp it would be a great image to me.  The washed out color and unsharp lines detract significantly.  When composing an image with simpler design elements I think it''s important to have them very clear.  By simple I mean that you have 6 similar springs as opposed to a landscape, or an intricate flower.  Hope this is helpful!', '2004-08-18 08:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(864940, 98391, 20673, '<td valign="top">Very creative - I like this.</td>', 'Very creative - I like this.', '2004-08-18 08:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(864944, 98520, 20204, '<td valign="top">For me there is not enough clarity in the subjects - a bit too much blur to be aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'For me there is not enough clarity in the subjects - a bit too much blur to be aesthetically pleasing.', '2004-08-18 08:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(864946, 98510, 20204, '<td valign="top">There is not enough contrast between the water and the lower material it is spilling over.  The image also appears blurred as though taken by hand at a slow shutter speed.</td>', 'There is not enough contrast between the water and the lower material it is spilling over.  The image also appears blurred as though taken by hand at a slow shutter speed.', '2004-08-18 08:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(864950, 97965, 20673, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh! - Are those light bright pegs?????? LOL LOVE IT!</td>', 'Oh my gosh! - Are those light bright pegs?????? LOL LOVE IT!', '2004-08-18 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(864951, 97269, 20204, '<td valign="top">What''s funny is that the web seems to naturally make the pattern of "WWW" in the lower left.  Nature''s own World Wide Web!  Cool image...  I''d like to see the depth of field blur out the background plant more.  I went with a natural neon theme too and am getting creamed for missing the theme - hope your doing better!</td>', 'What''s funny is that the web seems to naturally make the pattern of "WWW" in the lower left.  Nature''s own World Wide Web!  Cool image...  I''d like to see the depth of field blur out the background plant more.  I went with a natural neon theme too and am getting creamed for missing the theme - hope your doing better!', '2004-08-18 08:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(864953, 98517, 20673, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2004-08-18 08:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(864955, 98521, 20204, '<td valign="top">I really like the angles you used to fill the frame - very nice.</td>', 'I really like the angles you used to fill the frame - very nice.', '2004-08-18 08:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(864959, 98337, 20204, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a bit more brightness...</td>', 'Would like to see a bit more brightness...', '2004-08-18 08:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(864964, 97038, 20204, '<td valign="top">From the challenge description, neon is either the traditional glowing, or a very birtghly lit color.  I''m glad to see a non-glass-tube entry, but in this case I''m seeing a washed out land mass against a not very bright blue body of water.  I''m afraid I don''t see much relation to the challenge theme.  Ignoring the theme, I''d suggest this image was shot when the sun was too high as there is little textural detail in the ground.  Seems that there may be some sharpness problems on the outside as well.</td>', 'From the challenge description, neon is either the traditional glowing, or a very birtghly lit color.  I''m glad to see a non-glass-tube entry, but in this case I''m seeing a washed out land mass against a not very bright blue body of water.  I''m afraid I don''t see much relation to the challenge theme.  Ignoring the theme, I''d suggest this image was shot when the sun was too high as there is little textural detail in the ground.  Seems that there may be some sharpness problems on the outside as well.', '2004-08-18 08:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(864968, 98480, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the white edges here.  They are a bit distracting, and the image would have been cool on its own.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the white edges here.  They are a bit distracting, and the image would have been cool on its own.', '2004-08-18 08:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(864974, 97669, 18799, '<td valign="top">The challenge is met, and there are a lot of elements I like in this photo.  One thing I''m not too crazy about though is the choice of cropping - I would have liked to have seen more.  6</td>', 'The challenge is met, and there are a lot of elements I like in this photo.  One thing I''m not too crazy about though is the choice of cropping - I would have liked to have seen more.  6', '2004-08-18 08:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(864977, 97429, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think a tripod would have helped this image - it feels fuzzy all over.</td>', 'I think a tripod would have helped this image - it feels fuzzy all over.', '2004-08-18 08:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(864979, 97407, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the words "the illy" bring to this image.  I think it would be a stronger image if they were cropped out.</td>', 'Not sure what the words "the illy" bring to this image.  I think it would be a stronger image if they were cropped out.', '2004-08-18 08:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(864983, 97916, 20204, '<td valign="top">The uneven cropping (top/bottom) feels too tight to me.</td>', 'The uneven cropping (top/bottom) feels too tight to me.', '2004-08-18 08:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(864988, 97537, 20204, '<td valign="top">Thank you for doing something different - I was about to scream when I rerached your image :)  Nice bright color (which clearly meets the theme).  Depth of field is good in that most of the subject is in focus and the background is very well blurred, yet the rear petals of the flower are out of the field of focus which is a bit of a bummer.  Definitely a great image though, and kudos for not shotting a neon sign!</td>', 'Thank you for doing something different - I was about to scream when I rerached your image :)  Nice bright color (which clearly meets the theme).  Depth of field is good in that most of the subject is in focus and the background is very well blurred, yet the rear petals of the flower are out of the field of focus which is a bit of a bummer.  Definitely a great image though, and kudos for not shotting a neon sign!', '2004-08-18 08:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(864990, 98108, 18799, '<td valign="top">Ouch</td>', 'Ouch', '2004-08-18 08:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(864992, 98088, 20204, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any bright colors or neon in this image...  Not even by a stretch do I see any relation to the theme.  Very cute expresion.</td>', 'I don''t see any bright colors or neon in this image...  Not even by a stretch do I see any relation to the theme.  Very cute expresion.', '2004-08-18 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(864994, 98518, 20204, '<td valign="top">A biut less black area in the top would help this image for me.</td>', 'A biut less black area in the top would help this image for me.', '2004-08-18 08:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(865003, 98383, 23016, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, and i think it fit the challenge. I tryed for a couple of minute but I still don''t understand what''s the subjet! I will read the note. Good work!</td>', 'I like the colors, and i think it fit the challenge. I tryed for a couple of minute but I still don''t understand what''s the subjet! I will read the note. Good work!', '2004-08-18 08:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(865005, 97568, 17503, '<td valign="top">If all else fails...go back to basics! Nice idea...</td>', 'If all else fails...go back to basics! Nice idea...', '2004-08-18 08:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(865006, 97517, 23016, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. For this challenge probably you should enhance the gamma of the colors..</td>', 'Nice composition. For this challenge probably you should enhance the gamma of the colors..', '2004-08-18 08:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(865008, 98237, 17503, '<td valign="top">not sure what it is, but I love the colour</td>', 'not sure what it is, but I love the colour', '2004-08-18 08:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(865010, 98374, 23016, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Intresting the pattern you get with the long time exposure.</td>', 'Nice colors. Intresting the pattern you get with the long time exposure.', '2004-08-18 08:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(865011, 98311, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative choice of point of view - well done!</td>', 'Creative choice of point of view - well done!', '2004-08-18 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(865013, 98387, 17503, '<td valign="top">awesome, my fav.</td>', 'awesome, my fav.', '2004-08-18 08:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(865017, 97749, 23016, '<td valign="top">For this challenge I was waiting for much vivid colors... In my opinion is too much smooth.</td>', 'For this challenge I was waiting for much vivid colors... In my opinion is too much smooth.', '2004-08-18 08:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(865020, 98177, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not seeing a whole lot of neon in here, but its a cool image.</td>', 'Not seeing a whole lot of neon in here, but its a cool image.', '2004-08-18 08:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(865021, 98523, 23016, '<td valign="top">??? Is that a finger? Or maybe a knees? Not bad but not special (in my opinion!)</td>', '??? Is that a finger? Or maybe a knees? Not bad but not special (in my opinion!)', '2004-08-18 08:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(865024, 97867, 23016, '<td valign="top">good work, nice colors, perfect for this challenge</td>', 'good work, nice colors, perfect for this challenge', '2004-08-18 08:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(865026, 98108, 20204, '<td valign="top">Kudos for creativity - this image was a nice break from the norm!</td>', 'Kudos for creativity - this image was a nice break from the norm!', '2004-08-18 08:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(865029, 98342, 23016, '<td valign="top">I have only a note: you should tilt the photo few degrees clockwise!!</td>', 'I have only a note: you should tilt the photo few degrees clockwise!!', '2004-08-18 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(865031, 98262, 23016, '<td valign="top">Good focus, nice colors.</td>', 'Good focus, nice colors.', '2004-08-18 08:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(865034, 98345, 23016, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! good work1</td>', 'Wonderful! good work1', '2004-08-18 08:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(865035, 98315, 20204, '<td valign="top">Image is underexposed, blurry, and does not have a strong subject.</td>', 'Image is underexposed, blurry, and does not have a strong subject.', '2004-08-18 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(865039, 98084, 23016, '<td valign="top">Good idea. In my opinion there is too much black around the neon image.</td>', 'Good idea. In my opinion there is too much black around the neon image.', '2004-08-18 09:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(865040, 98247, 23016, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I don''t like the leaves in the background on the left.</td>', 'Good photo. I don''t like the leaves in the background on the left.', '2004-08-18 09:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(865042, 98534, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think a horizontal format would have worked better for me - the extra room at top and bottom feel awkward.  Very cool image!</td>', 'I think a horizontal format would have worked better for me - the extra room at top and bottom feel awkward.  Very cool image!', '2004-08-18 09:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(865045, 98391, 23016, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition! Good idea. I love the lighting of the flowers and the neon out of focus. Really well done!</td>', 'Interesting composition! Good idea. I love the lighting of the flowers and the neon out of focus. Really well done!', '2004-08-18 09:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(865046, 98511, 23016, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo but the colors aren''t so "neony".<br/>I like the composition, the displacement of the m&amp;m and the point of wiew.</td>', 'This is a good photo but the colors aren''t so "neony".I like the composition, the displacement of the m&m and the point of wiew.', '2004-08-18 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(865050, 98514, 23016, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors! Wonderful composition! Is it out of focus or the effect depend of the post processing? One of my favourite!</td>', 'Wonderful colors! Wonderful composition! Is it out of focus or the effect depend of the post processing? One of my favourite!', '2004-08-18 09:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(865075, 97238, 23016, '<td valign="top">A little bit blurry, or out of focus. Good color!</td>', 'A little bit blurry, or out of focus. Good color!', '2004-08-18 09:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(865078, 98230, 23016, '<td valign="top">A well known subject but good composition. Perfect for this challenge!</td>', 'A well known subject but good composition. Perfect for this challenge!', '2004-08-18 09:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(865080, 97869, 25510, '<td valign="top">Nice soft color</td>', 'Nice soft color', '2004-08-18 09:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(865083, 98235, 11738, '<td valign="top">I would have gone for a much tighter crop with the central figure as your main subject and having only parts of the other two figures showing.  Excellent exposure by the way.</td>', 'I would have gone for a much tighter crop with the central figure as your main subject and having only parts of the other two figures showing.  Excellent exposure by the way.', '2004-08-18 09:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(865085, 98331, 25510, '<td valign="top">Nice use of movement</td>', 'Nice use of movement', '2004-08-18 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(865087, 98094, 23016, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea! Extra wonderful title! Only 2 comments: the background should be choosen whit more attention and cropping away the upper zone of the photo makes the photo nicer!</td>', 'Wonderful idea! Extra wonderful title! Only 2 comments: the background should be choosen whit more attention and cropping away the upper zone of the photo makes the photo nicer!', '2004-08-18 09:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
