(865582, 97800, 13759, '<td valign="top">This picture is creative to the theme. But a bit boring and underexposed to me. Cats are not the best "neon" creatures in the world. If you want to show the glowing eyes, a good way was to get close enought to reveal only the cat´s face, like a portrait, in a better light condition.</td>', 'This picture is creative to the theme. But a bit boring and underexposed to me. Cats are not the best "neon" creatures in the world. If you want to show the glowing eyes, a good way was to get close enought to reveal only the cat´s face, like a portrait, in a better light condition.', '2004-08-18 12:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
