(865706, 98467, 24925, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but this picture makes me think of Pittsburgh.  So it''s definately an evocative shot, making me think of a chilly Saturday morning in the city.<br/> <br/>Some people might not like the cropping, but I personally like it, and I like the fact that all brightness and vividness has been removed from the neon by taking the shot during the day. I like this one.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but this picture makes me think of Pittsburgh.  So it''s definately an evocative shot, making me think of a chilly Saturday morning in the city. Some people might not like the cropping, but I personally like it, and I like the fact that all brightness and vividness has been removed from the neon by taking the shot during the day. I like this one.', '2004-08-18 13:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
