(865810, 97651, 7322, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a color-shifted, or inverted shot of a sink with NEON sprayed in shaving cream. <br/>It might have worked better in sharper focus and if you had taken a second to remove the bottle of handsoap which adds nothing to this idea. I''m not sure there would be much improvement, however. It''s not a shot I would suggest attempting a second time. I''m not finding much of interest to capture my attention and I''m not a fan of ''negative'' images. I will give you credit for using your imagination to create a neon effect.</td>', 'This appears to be a color-shifted, or inverted shot of a sink with NEON sprayed in shaving cream. It might have worked better in sharper focus and if you had taken a second to remove the bottle of handsoap which adds nothing to this idea. I''m not sure there would be much improvement, however. It''s not a shot I would suggest attempting a second time. I''m not finding much of interest to capture my attention and I''m not a fan of ''negative'' images. I will give you credit for using your imagination to create a neon effect.', '2004-08-18 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
