(865883, 97269, 23440, '<td valign="top">not very bright</td>', 'not very bright', '2004-08-18 14:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(865888, 98279, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract. I can''t help thinking the black cap (or whatever it is) intererrupts the flow a bit. I think if it was a solid black circle---if it didn''t have the glares and the line bisecting it, it would form an interesting coil or swirl shape accenting the green. That is a problem which is easily fixed with the clone tool, once the challenge is over.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. I can''t help thinking the black cap (or whatever it is) intererrupts the flow a bit. I think if it was a solid black circle---if it didn''t have the glares and the line bisecting it, it would form an interesting coil or swirl shape accenting the green. That is a problem which is easily fixed with the clone tool, once the challenge is over.', '2004-08-18 14:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(865889, 97509, 24454, '<td valign="top">This has a "hang it on the wall" feel to it.   9.    I would have given it a perfect 10 if there was just a little more light on the foreground items so it was easier to see them.  But it''s a really great picture!</td>', 'This has a "hang it on the wall" feel to it.   9.    I would have given it a perfect 10 if there was just a little more light on the foreground items so it was easier to see them.  But it''s a really great picture!', '2004-08-18 14:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(865891, 98345, 7322, '<td valign="top">Spooky. Great lighting on this.</td>', 'Spooky. Great lighting on this.', '2004-08-18 14:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(865894, 97334, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture!</td>', 'Very interesting picture!', '2004-08-18 14:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(865903, 97848, 7322, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the neon colors but it appears to be at the expense of the image. The flower appears very processed (oversaturated, perhaps?). I think the extreme post-processing would have worked with a tighter crop--perhaps just the edge of the flower and some of the yellow?  It would create a more dynamic composition which could carry the weight of the digital processing. As it is now, the composition, showing the flower in it''s entirety in it''s environment,  is too natural for the unnatural effect. I hope I''m making my point well. ;-D</td>', 'You''ve captured the neon colors but it appears to be at the expense of the image. The flower appears very processed (oversaturated, perhaps?). I think the extreme post-processing would have worked with a tighter crop--perhaps just the edge of the flower and some of the yellow?  It would create a more dynamic composition which could carry the weight of the digital processing. As it is now, the composition, showing the flower in it''s entirety in it''s environment,  is too natural for the unnatural effect. I hope I''m making my point well. ;-D', '2004-08-18 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(865922, 98462, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I would suggest that taking exposure from a grey card (or maybe the yellow bottle) would have yielded a better exposure. As it is, you have one blown out bottle, and one bottle nearly hidden in shadow. A way to get around reading from a gray card is to trick the meter with your EV setting.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I would suggest that taking exposure from a grey card (or maybe the yellow bottle) would have yielded a better exposure. As it is, you have one blown out bottle, and one bottle nearly hidden in shadow. A way to get around reading from a gray card is to trick the meter with your EV setting.', '2004-08-18 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(865927, 98178, 25599, '<td valign="top">Like the color combinations you used to make a neon rainbow.....</td>', 'Like the color combinations you used to make a neon rainbow.....', '2004-08-18 14:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(865934, 98087, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a fun subject but the lighting is very drab. A high key white background would work better to make the colors sing. To do that, simply set your EV mode to a + setting and it will overexpose the white background, reducing the shadow that makes it appear grey. Try a few + stops up until you achieve a good balance--you don''t want to overexpose the beads in the process. The grey background drabs down the colors of the beads. Also, try to create a seamless background to avoid the line bisecting the frame. For a subject this small, a piece of white paper taped to a vertical surface with a portion of it resting on the table works fine.</td>', 'This is a fun subject but the lighting is very drab. A high key white background would work better to make the colors sing. To do that, simply set your EV mode to a + setting and it will overexpose the white background, reducing the shadow that makes it appear grey. Try a few + stops up until you achieve a good balance--you don''t want to overexpose the beads in the process. The grey background drabs down the colors of the beads. Also, try to create a seamless background to avoid the line bisecting the frame. For a subject this small, a piece of white paper taped to a vertical surface with a portion of it resting on the table works fine.', '2004-08-18 14:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(865939, 98480, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting portrait. The color is appropriate for the child. I''d like to see a little more brightness in her face.</td>', 'Very interesting portrait. The color is appropriate for the child. I''d like to see a little more brightness in her face.', '2004-08-18 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(865944, 97446, 24435, '<td valign="top">this is cool but it needs cropping<br/></td>', 'this is cool but it needs cropping', '2004-08-18 14:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(865949, 97754, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like street photography but there should be something to capture my attention and this shot is lacking that something. The only thing that really captured my attention is the "Hungry Jacks" logo appears to be borrowing heavily from Burger King.</td>', 'I like street photography but there should be something to capture my attention and this shot is lacking that something. The only thing that really captured my attention is the "Hungry Jacks" logo appears to be borrowing heavily from Burger King.', '2004-08-18 14:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(865951, 98258, 7322, '<td valign="top">The color appears very drab to me. Almost white with only a bit of blue at the top of the letters.</td>', 'The color appears very drab to me. Almost white with only a bit of blue at the top of the letters.', '2004-08-18 15:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(865955, 98257, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot. I like the sharp angle of the wall, and the barbwire against the moody sky. The yellow glow of the lamp is also very striking. Unfortunately, I''m not really getting a feel of neon from the lamp light--it has more of a warm incandescent quality to it.</td>', 'This is a very good shot. I like the sharp angle of the wall, and the barbwire against the moody sky. The yellow glow of the lamp is also very striking. Unfortunately, I''m not really getting a feel of neon from the lamp light--it has more of a warm incandescent quality to it.', '2004-08-18 15:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(865959, 98512, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. Your picture frame appears a bit tilted to the left.</td>', 'Nice night shot. Your picture frame appears a bit tilted to the left.', '2004-08-18 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(865961, 98430, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2004-08-18 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(865962, 98489, 21478, '<td valign="top">Clever concept - I hope you don''t liquid paper your mistakes ;-)</td>', 'Clever concept - I hope you don''t liquid paper your mistakes ;-)', '2004-08-18 15:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(865963, 97651, 21478, '<td valign="top">interesting concept and nicely executed - except the effect makes it look blurry.</td>', 'interesting concept and nicely executed - except the effect makes it look blurry.', '2004-08-18 15:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(865965, 98116, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection and color.</td>', 'Great use of reflection and color.', '2004-08-18 15:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(865967, 98462, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice work - although it would have been nice if all the bottles were the same (ie. not diet coke).</td>', 'Nice work - although it would have been nice if all the bottles were the same (ie. not diet coke).', '2004-08-18 15:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(865968, 97429, 7322, '<td valign="top">While there is some neon in this composition, the focal point seems to be more about the arrangement of the chairs and the mood of closing time. The neon clock in the corner is just a small detail that actually distracts the eye in a negative way from the main composition.</td>', 'While there is some neon in this composition, the focal point seems to be more about the arrangement of the chairs and the mood of closing time. The neon clock in the corner is just a small detail that actually distracts the eye in a negative way from the main composition.', '2004-08-18 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(865969, 98235, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great shot - and the photo is good too! ;-)</td>', 'Great shot - and the photo is good too! ;-)', '2004-08-18 15:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(865973, 97238, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. It is a bit soft focus for a dynamic composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea. It is a bit soft focus for a dynamic composition.', '2004-08-18 15:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(865974, 98374, 21478, '<td valign="top">This has a "sex-education" feel about it ;-)</td>', 'This has a "sex-education" feel about it ;-)', '2004-08-18 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(865976, 97334, 7322, '<td valign="top">Somehow, the sight of the sign for ''Freshly Baked Bagels" is jarring after reading the title of the photo. It''s a fun concept but I don''t think the execution works too well.</td>', 'Somehow, the sight of the sign for ''Freshly Baked Bagels" is jarring after reading the title of the photo. It''s a fun concept but I don''t think the execution works too well.', '2004-08-18 15:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(865977, 98311, 21478, '<td valign="top">strange that you went the B&amp;W route on a neon competition. But here it works well as a stark white on black. Nice work.</td>', 'strange that you went the B&W route on a neon competition. But here it works well as a stark white on black. Nice work.', '2004-08-18 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(865979, 97665, 21478, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title - but I almost took a photo of the same thing...</td>', 'I don''t get the title - but I almost took a photo of the same thing...', '2004-08-18 15:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(865981, 97383, 25017, '<td valign="top">I love this!! It has a wonderful feeling, nostalgic even, would make a great album cover!</td>', 'I love this!! It has a wonderful feeling, nostalgic even, would make a great album cover!', '2004-08-18 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(865985, 97127, 23312, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, but it seems too pixelated to me.</td>', 'An interesting photo, but it seems too pixelated to me.', '2004-08-18 15:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(865986, 98216, 25017, '<td valign="top">lovely composition, very nice :)</td>', 'lovely composition, very nice :)', '2004-08-18 15:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(865987, 97299, 7322, '<td valign="top">The model needs to be placed further from the background.  When the model is shot so close to a background, the composition has a very claustrophobic, compressed feeling. It''s a nice pose and the cropping is good but the lighting appears harsh and unflattering. I like her hat but it isn''t a cowboy hat so the title is a bit confusing. Also, she is pulling at some pink lining (or something) from the inside of the hat and that is extremely distracting.</td>', 'The model needs to be placed further from the background.  When the model is shot so close to a background, the composition has a very claustrophobic, compressed feeling. It''s a nice pose and the cropping is good but the lighting appears harsh and unflattering. I like her hat but it isn''t a cowboy hat so the title is a bit confusing. Also, she is pulling at some pink lining (or something) from the inside of the hat and that is extremely distracting.', '2004-08-18 15:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(865989, 98257, 25017, '<td valign="top">very emotional pic, a lot of presence - nice</td>', 'very emotional pic, a lot of presence - nice', '2004-08-18 15:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(865990, 98088, 23312, '<td valign="top">Not seeing the "neon"...?</td>', 'Not seeing the "neon"...?', '2004-08-18 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(865994, 97429, 23312, '<td valign="top">Original idea - good lightinting and shadow.  I''d have liked to have the neon (is that a clock?) a little more overt to fit the challenge topic better.</td>', 'Original idea - good lightinting and shadow.  I''d have liked to have the neon (is that a clock?) a little more overt to fit the challenge topic better.', '2004-08-18 15:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(866004, 98447, 25017, '<td valign="top">cute! :)</td>', 'cute! :)', '2004-08-18 15:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(866031, 98326, 5354, '<td valign="top">Would have marked this down if there hadn''t been the health warning, but as it is I give it a 6.</td>', 'Would have marked this down if there hadn''t been the health warning, but as it is I give it a 6.', '2004-08-18 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(866035, 98108, 13136, '<td valign="top">Humor! Thank you.</td>', 'Humor! Thank you.', '2004-08-18 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
