(866039, 97914, 13759, '<td valign="top">Is well done, a good picture. Very simple and not very creative.  Do you read the challenge definition? How do you understando the "OPEN" word in it? Why "FAST" is so diferent of "OPEN"?</td>', 'Is well done, a good picture. Very simple and not very creative.  Do you read the challenge definition? How do you understando the "OPEN" word in it? Why "FAST" is so diferent of "OPEN"?', '2004-08-18 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
