(866050, 98270, 25576, '<td valign="top">Fantastic show.  I love how you hit the neon aspect of the challenge but showing out the light propogates outward -- almost like a behind the scenes view of what is going on with the billboard.</td>', 'Fantastic show.  I love how you hit the neon aspect of the challenge but showing out the light propogates outward -- almost like a behind the scenes view of what is going on with the billboard.', '2004-08-18 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
