(866610, 98094, 25065, '<td valign="top">That is VERY freaking cool! Some people won''t like the chubby guy, but I don''t care. I like this shot.8</td>', 'That is VERY freaking cool! Some people won''t like the chubby guy, but I don''t care. I like this shot.8', '2004-08-18 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
