(866627, 98088, 24896, '<td valign="top">i think this photo should be brighter and could use a bit of focus. I really like how the hair falls on her face. She just looks so cute. Its a nice crop too. as for the meeting the challenge sorry it doesn''t.</td>', 'i think this photo should be brighter and could use a bit of focus. I really like how the hair falls on her face. She just looks so cute. Its a nice crop too. as for the meeting the challenge sorry it doesn''t.', '2004-08-18 22:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(866628, 97613, 25065, '<td valign="top">Nice, original, interesting pic.</td>', 'Nice, original, interesting pic.', '2004-08-18 22:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(866629, 98084, 19978, '<td valign="top">There is so much dust, noise, or whatever in this photo, as well as some faintly visible background. These factors may drag down the score of what otherwise would have been a stand-out shot. This visual effect you have captured is stunning - I''d like to know what it is - but the noisy elements detract.</td>', 'There is so much dust, noise, or whatever in this photo, as well as some faintly visible background. These factors may drag down the score of what otherwise would have been a stand-out shot. This visual effect you have captured is stunning - I''d like to know what it is - but the noisy elements detract.', '2004-08-18 22:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(866631, 98487, 19978, '<td valign="top">I lacked the nerve to walk into a bar and ask someone to model for me. If I had, this is what I would have wanted as a composition. I give you a high score for pulling off something I could only hope for. Excellent entry and great response to the challenge!</td>', 'I lacked the nerve to walk into a bar and ask someone to model for me. If I had, this is what I would have wanted as a composition. I give you a high score for pulling off something I could only hope for. Excellent entry and great response to the challenge!', '2004-08-18 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(866632, 97553, 25065, '<td valign="top">Graphicfunk,  is that you? Very original, fascinating to look at. Great stuff, even if I guessed the artist wrong.</td>', 'Graphicfunk,  is that you? Very original, fascinating to look at. Great stuff, even if I guessed the artist wrong.', '2004-08-18 22:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(866635, 98518, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great idea, pose, crop, and subject. The way you''ve made the neon colors of the suit stand out is great. Good job all around.</td>', 'Great idea, pose, crop, and subject. The way you''ve made the neon colors of the suit stand out is great. Good job all around.', '2004-08-18 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
