(866644, 97873, 24896, '<td valign="top">if this was a painting "on canvas" I would find it very enjoyable.  As for a photograph I think clarity and focus are a must.....motion has its place for creating mood but this looks like a pic that was created by accident instead of capturing a moment.</td>', 'if this was a painting "on canvas" I would find it very enjoyable.  As for a photograph I think clarity and focus are a must.....motion has its place for creating mood but this looks like a pic that was created by accident instead of capturing a moment.', '2004-08-18 22:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
