(866850, 98187, 23956, '<td valign="top">I wish the bottom of the lotus hadn''t been lost, but this is still an excellent shot. Good job of using the zoom for effect while not losing the sharpness and saturation of the subject.</td>', 'I wish the bottom of the lotus hadn''t been lost, but this is still an excellent shot. Good job of using the zoom for effect while not losing the sharpness and saturation of the subject.', '2004-08-19 00:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(866854, 98254, 23956, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2004-08-19 00:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(866857, 97653, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really much of a composition. So much blurry foreground is rarely a good idea unless it frames a very interesting subject in an interesting way. This blur takes up have the picture plane and the guy is pretty mundane subject matter to anyone who doesn''t know him. The modern apartment building behind him doesn''t help things. The green of the grass makes for a pretty tenuous connection to the challenge. I would say it shows potential that you tried to create a frame with the foreground--it just doesn''t work in this case.</td>', 'This isn''t really much of a composition. So much blurry foreground is rarely a good idea unless it frames a very interesting subject in an interesting way. This blur takes up have the picture plane and the guy is pretty mundane subject matter to anyone who doesn''t know him. The modern apartment building behind him doesn''t help things. The green of the grass makes for a pretty tenuous connection to the challenge. I would say it shows potential that you tried to create a frame with the foreground--it just doesn''t work in this case.', '2004-08-19 00:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(866860, 98266, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition but I don''t care for the choice of blurring everything.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition but I don''t care for the choice of blurring everything.', '2004-08-19 00:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
