(866981, 98055, 8054, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection of the sign in the bodywork of the PT. I don''t know if many other people will also see the connection of the ''50s-era diner to the retro styling of the PT (assuming the diner is one of those ''50s style ones).<br/> <br/>Two nit-picky things that I can see:<br/>1. The spots below the I and the S in CRUISER.<br/>2. The badge is not completely in focus and I would have liked to see it all in focus.<br/> <br/>Good job overall. 7</td>', 'Love the reflection of the sign in the bodywork of the PT. I don''t know if many other people will also see the connection of the ''50s-era diner to the retro styling of the PT (assuming the diner is one of those ''50s style ones). Two nit-picky things that I can see:1. The spots below the I and the S in CRUISER.2. The badge is not completely in focus and I would have liked to see it all in focus. Good job overall. 7', '2004-08-19 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(866982, 98191, 25464, '<td valign="top">One of the few well done neon sign photos.  Good job.</td>', 'One of the few well done neon sign photos.  Good job.', '2004-08-19 02:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(866983, 97508, 25464, '<td valign="top">Unique neon sign view.  Well done.</td>', 'Unique neon sign view.  Well done.', '2004-08-19 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(866984, 97522, 18084, '<td valign="top">Excellent border around it.</td>', 'Excellent border around it.', '2004-08-19 02:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(866985, 98243, 22269, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and my 4 year old thinks it is awesome.  Great job....very creative!</td>', 'I really like this shot and my 4 year old thinks it is awesome.  Great job....very creative!', '2004-08-19 02:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(866986, 97522, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice but appears a bit out of focus to me. Great idea.</td>', 'Nice but appears a bit out of focus to me. Great idea.', '2004-08-19 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(866988, 98076, 25464, '<td valign="top">Unique photo, interesting, but not exactly meeting the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'Unique photo, interesting, but not exactly meeting the challenge in my opinion.', '2004-08-19 02:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(866989, 97518, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice engine details but I can see noise on the valve covers and on your air intake (?) above the butterflies. Also, the neon light is a bit weak, in my opinion, not making enough of a presence in this photo.</td>', 'Nice engine details but I can see noise on the valve covers and on your air intake (?) above the butterflies. Also, the neon light is a bit weak, in my opinion, not making enough of a presence in this photo.', '2004-08-19 02:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
