(866996, 97869, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure if this falls in the neon category although the color sure looks the part. One of the more original entries.</td>', 'Not quite sure if this falls in the neon category although the color sure looks the part. One of the more original entries.', '2004-08-19 02:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(866997, 97673, 22269, '<td valign="top">It is always fun to see some humor in the challenges....good job!</td>', 'It is always fun to see some humor in the challenges....good job!', '2004-08-19 02:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(866999, 97563, 22269, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the neon part of the picture.</td>', 'I don''t see the neon part of the picture.', '2004-08-19 02:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(867001, 97800, 22269, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are really bright!  Picture is really grainy though....</td>', 'Those eyes are really bright!  Picture is really grainy though....', '2004-08-19 02:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(867002, 97874, 8054, '<td valign="top">I know it doesn''t appear so but the sun rays and the water look like their tubes are almost the same color. Did you crank the saturation up? It looks like you might have and/or used a very high ISO setting. Maybe some of the pixels are clipping and causing those colors to look identical. I do like the composition with the water on the bottom and the sun in the corner.</td>', 'I know it doesn''t appear so but the sun rays and the water look like their tubes are almost the same color. Did you crank the saturation up? It looks like you might have and/or used a very high ISO setting. Maybe some of the pixels are clipping and causing those colors to look identical. I do like the composition with the water on the bottom and the sun in the corner.', '2004-08-19 02:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(867003, 97800, 12061, '<td valign="top">What an adorable kitten! .. but not fitting for the challenge</td>', 'What an adorable kitten! .. but not fitting for the challenge', '2004-08-19 02:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(867004, 98353, 21362, '<td valign="top">Cool flower. I think I might have tried getting in closer on it, and shifting the frame a bit from a static centered position. I really like the contrast of the bright pink and bright yellow though.</td>', 'Cool flower. I think I might have tried getting in closer on it, and shifting the frame a bit from a static centered position. I really like the contrast of the bright pink and bright yellow though.', '2004-08-19 02:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(867005, 98432, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am left wondering what the rest of the building looked like.  I think a step back might have made this more interesting.</td>', 'I am left wondering what the rest of the building looked like.  I think a step back might have made this more interesting.', '2004-08-19 02:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(867006, 97537, 12061, '<td valign="top">Its nice to see something different what with all the redundant voting. This picture has great DOF and color, its not *quite so neon for me, but I still love it. =) 7.</td>', 'Its nice to see something different what with all the redundant voting. This picture has great DOF and color, its not *quite so neon for me, but I still love it. =) 7.', '2004-08-19 02:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(867008, 97755, 8054, '<td valign="top">The beer mug and the object in the lower right are distracting.</td>', 'The beer mug and the object in the lower right are distracting.', '2004-08-19 02:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(867009, 98427, 8054, '<td valign="top">Lots of compression as I can see banding in the yellow.</td>', 'Lots of compression as I can see banding in the yellow.', '2004-08-19 02:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(867010, 98474, 8054, '<td valign="top">This woould be more impressive if there was less building and more sign.</td>', 'This woould be more impressive if there was less building and more sign.', '2004-08-19 02:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
