(867035, 97622, 23561, '<td valign="top">Very abstract looking. I was wondering what type of flower that is. The coloring is perfect. I was also wondering how much, if any, color adjustments had to be made. My favorite this round.</td>', 'Very abstract looking. I was wondering what type of flower that is. The coloring is perfect. I was also wondering how much, if any, color adjustments had to be made. My favorite this round.', '2004-08-19 03:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
