(867288, 97909, 19841, '<td valign="top">This really isn''t much more than a document of the sign.  It''s a nice sign, well photographed, but there isn''t much interest.  A different angle, or including some of the building, would have added interest.</td>', 'This really isn''t much more than a document of the sign.  It''s a nice sign, well photographed, but there isn''t much interest.  A different angle, or including some of the building, would have added interest.', '2004-08-19 10:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
