(867471, 98257, 24951, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you''ll get ''it''s too dark'' comments. I think it adds to theme and the photo itself. The barbed wire in silouette is a good idea. With the ominous dark clouds it certainly works for me. Oh I suppose the bright light could have been toned done a fraction, but what the hay like I said it works for me.</td>', 'I wonder if you''ll get ''it''s too dark'' comments. I think it adds to theme and the photo itself. The barbed wire in silouette is a good idea. With the ominous dark clouds it certainly works for me. Oh I suppose the bright light could have been toned done a fraction, but what the hay like I said it works for me.', '2004-08-19 12:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(867476, 97965, 24951, '<td valign="top">Normally in focus/out of focus - it depends on the shot. This is one shot that I must say would have liked to see real sharp and crisp. I think it would have made this photo outstanding.</td>', 'Normally in focus/out of focus - it depends on the shot. This is one shot that I must say would have liked to see real sharp and crisp. I think it would have made this photo outstanding.', '2004-08-19 12:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(867481, 97669, 24951, '<td valign="top">This in one photo that really would have looked amazing if it had been real clean and crisp. I wonder also what this shot would have been like if the boat had appeared higher up in the shot accentuating the foreground more.</td>', 'This in one photo that really would have looked amazing if it had been real clean and crisp. I wonder also what this shot would have been like if the boat had appeared higher up in the shot accentuating the foreground more.', '2004-08-19 12:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(867482, 97537, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Good DOF.</td>', 'Nice shot! Good DOF.', '2004-08-19 12:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(867488, 97600, 24951, '<td valign="top">This a better shot then I would like to see. I''m tempted to score it lower than it deserves, coz I wish it wasn''t as good as it is. I think the ripple effect enhances the blue and red. Oh I''m sure someone will complain about the foreground being out of focus, but I think it lends itself to the idea of motion. Red lined border adds a nice touch. (9) from me.</td>', 'This a better shot then I would like to see. I''m tempted to score it lower than it deserves, coz I wish it wasn''t as good as it is. I think the ripple effect enhances the blue and red. Oh I''m sure someone will complain about the foreground being out of focus, but I think it lends itself to the idea of motion. Red lined border adds a nice touch. (9) from me.', '2004-08-19 12:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(867493, 97195, 24951, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the objects a little larger in the frame. Maybe you were worried about cutting off the reflection? I wonder what this shot would have been like if taken vertically. I don''t really mind that it isn''t sharp as a tack, but I think in this case it might have added to the shot.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the objects a little larger in the frame. Maybe you were worried about cutting off the reflection? I wonder what this shot would have been like if taken vertically. I don''t really mind that it isn''t sharp as a tack, but I think in this case it might have added to the shot.', '2004-08-19 13:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(867496, 98331, 24951, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been cooler if the background from after the boxy thing with the word music on it was black.</td>', 'I think it would have been cooler if the background from after the boxy thing with the word music on it was black.', '2004-08-19 13:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(867497, 98224, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and nice "slant" on the subject!</td>', 'Interesting photo and nice "slant" on the subject!', '2004-08-19 13:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(867506, 98498, 24951, '<td valign="top">Anyone that would give this a low mark is an idiot or is. . .I don''t know worried about their own photo. . . blind. . .This obviously a well composed, professional looking shot and I hate you for it ;-) just kidding - I am neon green with envy. The only thing I can say negatively - and I''m reaching here - is  the angle tends to maybe accentuate the nose holes just a tad. Maybe if her head had been slightly turned (to our left)so the eye would still be included or tilted down slightly . . .just a thought. It''s still a 10 damn it anyway ;-)</td>', 'Anyone that would give this a low mark is an idiot or is. . .I don''t know worried about their own photo. . . blind. . .This obviously a well composed, professional looking shot and I hate you for it ;-) just kidding - I am neon green with envy. The only thing I can say negatively - and I''m reaching here - is  the angle tends to maybe accentuate the nose holes just a tad. Maybe if her head had been slightly turned (to our left)so the eye would still be included or tilted down slightly . . .just a thought. It''s still a 10 damn it anyway ;-)', '2004-08-19 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
