(867697, 98512, 16493, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and reflection.<br/>composition could be better or diffrent crop. Try croping of the top above the bright light.</td>', 'Nice colors and reflection.composition could be better or diffrent crop. Try croping of the top above the bright light.', '2004-08-19 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
