(867708, 98458, 16493, '<td valign="top">Fisth, rabbit and duck. very funny pocket pets.<br/>Usually I don''t like frames but this one is diffrent but its a bit destracting.<br/>very creative.</td>', 'Fisth, rabbit and duck. very funny pocket pets.Usually I don''t like frames but this one is diffrent but its a bit destracting.very creative.', '2004-08-19 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
