(868221, 98108, 22011, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit harsh, and the shadow to the upper left is a little distracting, but otherwise a great photo.  You''ve got the focus on the lights, and the shallow DOF has the denim just out of focus, really drawing the eye to the glass work.<br/> <br/>I might have been tempted to remove the writing from the top of the standard bulb though, as the ''double text'' look from the shadow makes it look a little out of focus in that area.<br/> <br/>I feel that the picture is slightly ''top heavy'' though, possibly a lighter dennim to lighten the top of the frame, or a even a naked knee, which would of course allowed you to enter in two challenges for the price of one.  Maybe a white sheet of paper just out of frame on the left to give some fill lighting to the shadows would have worked as well.<br/> <br/>I got a giggle out of this, so it deserves a long comment :-).  a solid 8.</td>', 'The light is a bit harsh, and the shadow to the upper left is a little distracting, but otherwise a great photo.  You''ve got the focus on the lights, and the shallow DOF has the denim just out of focus, really drawing the eye to the glass work. I might have been tempted to remove the writing from the top of the standard bulb though, as the ''double text'' look from the shadow makes it look a little out of focus in that area. I feel that the picture is slightly ''top heavy'' though, possibly a lighter dennim to lighten the top of the frame, or a even a naked knee, which would of course allowed you to enter in two challenges for the price of one.  Maybe a white sheet of paper just out of frame on the left to give some fill lighting to the shadows would have worked as well. I got a giggle out of this, so it deserves a long comment :-).  a solid 8.', '2004-08-20 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(868224, 98467, 19708, '<td valign="top">Urban feel with a sense of Mom &amp; Pop kinda'' place.<br/>Interesting composition - many angles &amp; intersections. Not sure if it helps or distracts.<br/>Possibly a tad over exposed?<br/></td>', 'Urban feel with a sense of Mom & Pop kinda'' place.Interesting composition - many angles & intersections. Not sure if it helps or distracts.Possibly a tad over exposed?', '2004-08-20 00:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
