(868262, 97135, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good picture. I really like it. The oly issue is the yellow/orange botton. It was good in full green. Changing the crop you may get only green.</td>', 'Good picture. I really like it. The oly issue is the yellow/orange botton. It was good in full green. Changing the crop you may get only green.', '2004-08-20 01:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
