(868382, 98436, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good colors - looks like it could use some ccw rotation though.  If this was intentional, it doesn''t work for me.   Nice exposure on the underside of the (roof?)</td>', 'Good colors - looks like it could use some ccw rotation though.  If this was intentional, it doesn''t work for me.   Nice exposure on the underside of the (roof?)', '2004-08-20 08:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(868383, 97753, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting.  There is a lot of dead space on the sides.  I would suggest that a vertical shot or crop would have been better.  Also, I would like to see just a little bit more on the bottom so the orange guy''s chin is more in frame.  Overall nice effort     6</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting.  There is a lot of dead space on the sides.  I would suggest that a vertical shot or crop would have been better.  Also, I would like to see just a little bit more on the bottom so the orange guy''s chin is more in frame.  Overall nice effort     6', '2004-08-20 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(868384, 97517, 18799, '<td valign="top">The colors are great and attract my eye - after the initial wow facto of the bright colors on blackr,  I lose interest pretty quickly.</td>', 'The colors are great and attract my eye - after the initial wow facto of the bright colors on blackr,  I lose interest pretty quickly.', '2004-08-20 08:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(868386, 97873, 18799, '<td valign="top">Certainly bright, but a little too messy and blown out for my tastes.</td>', 'Certainly bright, but a little too messy and blown out for my tastes.', '2004-08-20 08:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(868388, 97135, 18799, '<td valign="top">I played around with this and found that I liked it much better if it was cropped just above the bright orange light in the foreground.   I love the greens, but the brightness of the foreground is very distracting to me.</td>', 'I played around with this and found that I liked it much better if it was cropped just above the bright orange light in the foreground.   I love the greens, but the brightness of the foreground is very distracting to me.', '2004-08-20 08:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
