(868390, 98431, 18799, '<td valign="top">Could have been a little brighter, I think.</td>', 'Could have been a little brighter, I think.', '2004-08-20 09:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(868391, 98330, 18799, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s neon.  Other than that, the composition needs a lot of work - the cropping of the building and all the dead space don''t do anything for me.  I do like the reflection though.</td>', 'Well, it''s neon.  Other than that, the composition needs a lot of work - the cropping of the building and all the dead space don''t do anything for me.  I do like the reflection though.', '2004-08-20 09:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
