(868452, 98279, 24171, '<td valign="top">This would look much better, in my opinion, if the light was suspended over a black bg, in the same position with the lamp glowing from the lights you used. It''s a nice shot, but the stray color on the ground makes it appear muddled (Again, in my opinion) Also, I''d try and avoid the reflections on the end of the tube</td>', 'This would look much better, in my opinion, if the light was suspended over a black bg, in the same position with the lamp glowing from the lights you used. It''s a nice shot, but the stray color on the ground makes it appear muddled (Again, in my opinion) Also, I''d try and avoid the reflections on the end of the tube', '2004-08-20 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
