(868571, 97965, 18868, '<td valign="top">very busy.  somewhat overexposed.  notice how the large areas of whites are all blank?  that can''t be fixed in photoshop -- expose the shot so there''s tone in the highlights then move the midtone around in photoshop.</td>', 'very busy.  somewhat overexposed.  notice how the large areas of whites are all blank?  that can''t be fixed in photoshop -- expose the shot so there''s tone in the highlights then move the midtone around in photoshop.', '2004-08-20 13:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
