(868604, 98510, 18868, '<td valign="top">Ooo, so close -- this is almost a fabulous image.  Your approach is sort of in between techniques: fast shutter to capure the droplets or slow shutter to make the falling water look as smooth as silk.  Either way, definitely a tripod and timer/cable release is the way to go.</td>', 'Ooo, so close -- this is almost a fabulous image.  Your approach is sort of in between techniques: fast shutter to capure the droplets or slow shutter to make the falling water look as smooth as silk.  Either way, definitely a tripod and timer/cable release is the way to go.', '2004-08-20 14:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
