(868701, 98501, 24171, '<td valign="top">I thought this was some kind of fish or eel thing at first... but hten I realized it''s a top-down shot of one of those ''energy'' lamps.. the swirly kind :) neat image</td>', 'I thought this was some kind of fish or eel thing at first... but hten I realized it''s a top-down shot of one of those ''energy'' lamps.. the swirly kind :) neat image', '2004-08-20 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(868725, 97518, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unique image with a real mood to it.<br/>On a personal note, the border for me doesn''t do anything for the shot and may have been a touch better in black. Just a touch on the noisy side, but knowing the type of shot this is, getting the image in under the 150K mark I bet was tough.<br/>Well Done - ((7))</td>', 'Unique image with a real mood to it.On a personal note, the border for me doesn''t do anything for the shot and may have been a touch better in black. Just a touch on the noisy side, but knowing the type of shot this is, getting the image in under the 150K mark I bet was tough.Well Done - ((7))', '2004-08-20 16:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(868728, 97517, 19708, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean &amp; effective.<br/>Good detail level. I mulled around wondering if the slight hint of the bottom of the cup was necesary or a distraction. Jury''s still out on that one.<br/>Well Done - ((7))</td>', 'Simple, clean & effective.Good detail level. I mulled around wondering if the slight hint of the bottom of the cup was necesary or a distraction. Jury''s still out on that one.Well Done - ((7))', '2004-08-20 16:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(868751, 98391, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very good &amp; unique composition.<br/>Lighting is tough in this setting and just wish the flower highlights weren''t so blown out.<br/>I''d be interested to see if the camera neon was on a monitor or out in th ereal world.<br/>Well Done ((7))</td>', 'Very good & unique composition.Lighting is tough in this setting and just wish the flower highlights weren''t so blown out.I''d be interested to see if the camera neon was on a monitor or out in th ereal world.Well Done ((7))', '2004-08-20 17:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(868753, 98518, 19708, '<td valign="top">Black lighting objects can sure change an appearance.<br/>Good composition &amp; unique approach to the challenge.<br/>Just wish the swimsuit was a bit darker and not appearing over-exposed.<br/>Well Done ((7))<br/></td>', 'Black lighting objects can sure change an appearance.Good composition & unique approach to the challenge.Just wish the swimsuit was a bit darker and not appearing over-exposed.Well Done ((7))', '2004-08-20 17:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(868759, 98500, 24659, '<td valign="top">Nice effect!</td>', 'Nice effect!', '2004-08-20 17:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(868761, 98506, 24659, '<td valign="top">Neat effect!  A bit blurry, but still cool.</td>', 'Neat effect!  A bit blurry, but still cool.', '2004-08-20 17:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(868782, 98428, 7322, '<td valign="top">Neon? The yellow on that bandaid doesn''t look like neon or day-glo to me. It''s  a rather muted and pale lemon color. <br/> <br/>Returned to edit critique....<br/> <br/>I like the lighting on the foot and the dark background. I find the narrow, horizontal cropping a bit awkward for the subject matter which suggests a vertical format with perhaps two-thirds of the negative space leading away from the point of the foot for a more dynamic composition. I''m not sure there is enough going on here in terms of form and space to make this a really compelling photo for me.</td>', 'Neon? The yellow on that bandaid doesn''t look like neon or day-glo to me. It''s  a rather muted and pale lemon color.  Returned to edit critique.... I like the lighting on the foot and the dark background. I find the narrow, horizontal cropping a bit awkward for the subject matter which suggests a vertical format with perhaps two-thirds of the negative space leading away from the point of the foot for a more dynamic composition. I''m not sure there is enough going on here in terms of form and space to make this a really compelling photo for me.', '2004-08-20 17:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(868785, 98327, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject and a good start. However, I feel like you should have waited for it to be completely dark and used a tripod to really capture a stunning shot of this building. Another suggestion is to crop out the bottom portion of the building and the trees since they add nothing of viewing interest, in my opinion. My final suggestion would be to take the shot from slightly left or right of the building to really capture the angularity of the three sections jutting out from the building. From this nearly straight on point of view, they get somewhat ''flattened'' out. This might have the added benefit of eliminating the "Alamo" tower which attracts the eye away from the main subject with little reward.</td>', 'This is a good subject and a good start. However, I feel like you should have waited for it to be completely dark and used a tripod to really capture a stunning shot of this building. Another suggestion is to crop out the bottom portion of the building and the trees since they add nothing of viewing interest, in my opinion. My final suggestion would be to take the shot from slightly left or right of the building to really capture the angularity of the three sections jutting out from the building. From this nearly straight on point of view, they get somewhat ''flattened'' out. This might have the added benefit of eliminating the "Alamo" tower which attracts the eye away from the main subject with little reward.', '2004-08-20 17:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(868813, 98191, 15129, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I would have rated it higher if the colors were brighter, but it is a great picture.</td>', 'Very cool. I would have rated it higher if the colors were brighter, but it is a great picture.', '2004-08-20 18:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(868814, 98412, 15129, '<td valign="top">It seems to need more contrast. Have you tried tweaking it in Photoshop?</td>', 'It seems to need more contrast. Have you tried tweaking it in Photoshop?', '2004-08-20 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(868836, 98498, 9690, '<td valign="top">Best of the challenge!</td>', 'Best of the challenge!', '2004-08-20 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(868842, 97665, 24674, '<td valign="top">Intriguing</td>', 'Intriguing', '2004-08-20 18:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(868843, 98335, 24674, '<td valign="top">A bit too dirty</td>', 'A bit too dirty', '2004-08-20 19:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(868851, 97383, 23312, '<td valign="top">A bit more exposure wouldn''t hurt - to give some more pizaz to the brighter "neon" colors.</td>', 'A bit more exposure wouldn''t hurt - to give some more pizaz to the brighter "neon" colors.', '2004-08-20 19:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(868866, 98109, 19608, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  A dead-centered composition that works.  It''s very artistic ad a bit mysterious.  I think it would be a bit stronger if the color saturation were raised a bit.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  A dead-centered composition that works.  It''s very artistic ad a bit mysterious.  I think it would be a bit stronger if the color saturation were raised a bit.', '2004-08-20 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(868869, 98464, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Color saturation with the black really worked well for you. The only thing I don''t like is the white in the border.</td>', 'Well done.  Color saturation with the black really worked well for you. The only thing I don''t like is the white in the border.', '2004-08-20 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(868872, 98502, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken an overdone object - and did something really unique with it.  The colors are perfect for neon - and go great with the black background.</td>', 'You''ve taken an overdone object - and did something really unique with it.  The colors are perfect for neon - and go great with the black background.', '2004-08-20 19:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(868877, 97557, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s actually a very intersting whirl of colors, but the cat is barely discernable.  (All I''m saying is that the title could be better.)  I like it very much but I would guess most of the DPC crowd will think it is too "artsy" for their taste.</td>', 'It''s actually a very intersting whirl of colors, but the cat is barely discernable.  (All I''m saying is that the title could be better.)  I like it very much but I would guess most of the DPC crowd will think it is too "artsy" for their taste.', '2004-08-20 19:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(868878, 98094, 25140, '<td valign="top">It''s really cool how you captured time.  I like how you illuminated the light writer, it makes the photo interesting.</td>', 'It''s really cool how you captured time.  I like how you illuminated the light writer, it makes the photo interesting.', '2004-08-20 19:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(868880, 98523, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice combination of colors.</td>', 'A very nice combination of colors.', '2004-08-20 19:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(868881, 97888, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice but the image does not do much for me.</td>', 'Colors are nice but the image does not do much for me.', '2004-08-20 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(868883, 97753, 10390, '<td valign="top">A tighter vertical crop would have made this better, but this is not bad, 70% my guess.</td>', 'A tighter vertical crop would have made this better, but this is not bad, 70% my guess.', '2004-08-20 19:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(868885, 98057, 19708, '<td valign="top">The colors are stunning and is a great choice for this challenge.<br/>Shame the shadows are on the Toucan''s bill. A liitle cleanup, sharpening and cloning<br/>would have made this shot pop off the page !(darn open challenges..)<br/>Looks very similar to the March free study entry - was (and still) in my favorites.<br/>Good choice - ((7))<br/></td>', 'The colors are stunning and is a great choice for this challenge.Shame the shadows are on the Toucan''s bill. A liitle cleanup, sharpening and cloningwould have made this shot pop off the page !(darn open challenges..)Looks very similar to the March free study entry - was (and still) in my favorites.Good choice - ((7))', '2004-08-20 19:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(868886, 98497, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely neon - so it meets the challenge.  Too bad so many people came up with the same idea.   Your diagonal composition works well.</td>', 'It''s definitely neon - so it meets the challenge.  Too bad so many people came up with the same idea.   Your diagonal composition works well.', '2004-08-20 19:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(868888, 97848, 19608, '<td valign="top">It looks like it would be a pretty nice rose - but the overexposure ruins it.  I know it''s probably deliberate for the neon color, but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'It looks like it would be a pretty nice rose - but the overexposure ruins it.  I know it''s probably deliberate for the neon color, but it doesn''t work for me.', '2004-08-20 19:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(868889, 97754, 10390, '<td valign="top">To much going on in this photo fore my taste and it brings the photo down to cut off the feet as you do, just a little bit lower aim and it would have raised the ratings.  On the other hand I would have suggested a vertical framing with focusing on the left side of the motive focusing on the Hungry Jack''s, then with all of the feets in the frame and also more of the house at the top.</td>', 'To much going on in this photo fore my taste and it brings the photo down to cut off the feet as you do, just a little bit lower aim and it would have raised the ratings.  On the other hand I would have suggested a vertical framing with focusing on the left side of the motive focusing on the Hungry Jack''s, then with all of the feets in the frame and also more of the house at the top.', '2004-08-20 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(868890, 98515, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a weird optical illusion for me.  I actually like the thumbnail better than the larger version.  I don''t like the border at all - and wonder why it''s uneven and has the dark spec on the right side.  Nice colors work well with the b/g.</td>', 'This is a weird optical illusion for me.  I actually like the thumbnail better than the larger version.  I don''t like the border at all - and wonder why it''s uneven and has the dark spec on the right side.  Nice colors work well with the b/g.', '2004-08-20 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(868892, 97600, 10390, '<td valign="top">Damn, you missed the focus point, maybe a faster shutter speed would have helped, but as it is this is not going to score high imo, nice try though and good title.</td>', 'Damn, you missed the focus point, maybe a faster shutter speed would have helped, but as it is this is not going to score high imo, nice try though and good title.', '2004-08-20 19:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(868893, 98374, 10390, '<td valign="top">I like your braveness, but this is not as good as it could be, maybe a little level''s work in PS would help this a lot.  Also there''s nothing interesting enough in the frame, but brave as I said.</td>', 'I like your braveness, but this is not as good as it could be, maybe a little level''s work in PS would help this a lot.  Also there''s nothing interesting enough in the frame, but brave as I said.', '2004-08-20 19:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(868897, 98088, 19608, '<td valign="top">A lovely young lady and nice portrait.  The hair relly adds .  It''s too small though and I really don''t think anything says "neon" to me.</td>', 'A lovely young lady and nice portrait.  The hair relly adds .  It''s too small though and I really don''t think anything says "neon" to me.', '2004-08-20 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(868898, 98254, 10390, '<td valign="top">A tighter landscape crop would have worked better for this motive imo, the dark parts at the top and bottom doesn''t add anything, but I like the center of the photo.</td>', 'A tighter landscape crop would have worked better for this motive imo, the dark parts at the top and bottom doesn''t add anything, but I like the center of the photo.', '2004-08-20 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
