(869711, 98257, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a good capture.  I love the colours and the angle you have chosen and the wires too.  But I feel that during post-processing, the edges have gone all wonky  - and it''s not too pleasing.  Maybe you could try the to create the same image without destroying those areas.</td>', 'Nice composition and a good capture.  I love the colours and the angle you have chosen and the wires too.  But I feel that during post-processing, the edges have gone all wonky  - and it''s not too pleasing.  Maybe you could try the to create the same image without destroying those areas.', '2004-08-21 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
