(869716, 98193, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, detail, colors and composition. I think a more balanced lighting would have worked better.  Also you can create nice effects with objects like these with a light from behind.</td>', 'I like the idea, detail, colors and composition. I think a more balanced lighting would have worked better.  Also you can create nice effects with objects like these with a light from behind.', '2004-08-21 19:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
