(869766, 98257, 25725, '<td valign="top">Hi there! This is my 2nd comment on the website, so I''m still not sure on how to actually do this :P Also forgive me for my English ;)<br/> <br/>I''m clearly not a pro at photography (taking or commenting), but it like the contrast between the yellow/orange of the lamp with the dark sky. The barbed wire tells me it might be a prison''s lamp, it kinda makes me feel happy I''m sitting here instead of in there.<br/> <br/>All in all, I think it''s a good pic :)</td>', 'Hi there! This is my 2nd comment on the website, so I''m still not sure on how to actually do this :P Also forgive me for my English ;) I''m clearly not a pro at photography (taking or commenting), but it like the contrast between the yellow/orange of the lamp with the dark sky. The barbed wire tells me it might be a prison''s lamp, it kinda makes me feel happy I''m sitting here instead of in there. All in all, I think it''s a good pic :)', '2004-08-21 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
