(870096, 98074, 25725, '<td valign="top">Hi! I''m not a professional on the subject, but this neon challenge seems hard. Photographing a neon sign or a bright colour alone doesnt look easy, but you manage to take a cool shot :)</td>', 'Hi! I''m not a professional on the subject, but this neon challenge seems hard. Photographing a neon sign or a bright colour alone doesnt look easy, but you manage to take a cool shot :)', '2004-08-22 09:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
