(870214, 97756, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''ve been back to view this photo several times now during voting. I''m increasingly convinced that the power lines just detract too much from the overall simplicity of the image. You''ve composed a lovely shot that has everything going for it but the power lines are a killer. Their presence is distracting, especially where they get overwhelmed by the deep orange hues just above the sun''s disk. Still an excellent photo worth of this challenge and with many powerful qualities. 7.</td>', 'I''ve been back to view this photo several times now during voting. I''m increasingly convinced that the power lines just detract too much from the overall simplicity of the image. You''ve composed a lovely shot that has everything going for it but the power lines are a killer. Their presence is distracting, especially where they get overwhelmed by the deep orange hues just above the sun''s disk. Still an excellent photo worth of this challenge and with many powerful qualities. 7.', '2004-08-22 12:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(870218, 97408, 13044, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you will get comments critical of the backward words. I however can figiure out what the sign says. That said, I like the color and composition to vote this rather well.</td>', 'I''m sure you will get comments critical of the backward words. I however can figiure out what the sign says. That said, I like the color and composition to vote this rather well.', '2004-08-22 13:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
