(870347, 97909, 12061, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better sign shots, great color focus and composition, but the subject just isn''t appealing to me ... a 6</td>', 'This is one of the better sign shots, great color focus and composition, but the subject just isn''t appealing to me ... a 6', '2004-08-22 16:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(870350, 98464, 12061, '<td valign="top">This is interesting .. I love the fact that its unique, and it is technically composed very well. All the black space isn''t doing it for me, as well, that white border I think would look better yellow or red to match the subject color.</td>', 'This is interesting .. I love the fact that its unique, and it is technically composed very well. All the black space isn''t doing it for me, as well, that white border I think would look better yellow or red to match the subject color.', '2004-08-22 16:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(870352, 97135, 12061, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors on the water, but personally, I would have made this a horizontal picture and cut off the orange color at the bottom .. its just not adding to the image for me, as well, it throws off the balance of the photo because its not perfectly straight, and everything else is. <br/> <br/>Overall, this is a nice, unique shot and I''m sure you''ll do good with this one.</td>', 'Lovely colors on the water, but personally, I would have made this a horizontal picture and cut off the orange color at the bottom .. its just not adding to the image for me, as well, it throws off the balance of the photo because its not perfectly straight, and everything else is.  Overall, this is a nice, unique shot and I''m sure you''ll do good with this one.', '2004-08-22 16:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(870356, 98474, 12061, '<td valign="top">I love the warm feeling of this shot, and the crispness is right on. Too bad all the signs were''nt as crisp and neat looking as the "Italian Dinners" sign. I''m not sure how much this would help, but I think perhaps cutting out the apartment building to the right and making the restaurant the main composition would help .. my focus is being drawn to the bright apartment building when I should be more drawn to the restaurant. Anyway, good work, you''ll place high with this one.</td>', 'I love the warm feeling of this shot, and the crispness is right on. Too bad all the signs were''nt as crisp and neat looking as the "Italian Dinners" sign. I''m not sure how much this would help, but I think perhaps cutting out the apartment building to the right and making the restaurant the main composition would help .. my focus is being drawn to the bright apartment building when I should be more drawn to the restaurant. Anyway, good work, you''ll place high with this one.', '2004-08-22 16:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(870362, 97377, 12061, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely composition, the colors are great, and contrast is spot on. The focus is a tad soft when it feels it shouldn''t be. Because orange is a dominant color in this photograph I would have also put the border a color to match.</td>', 'This is a lovely composition, the colors are great, and contrast is spot on. The focus is a tad soft when it feels it shouldn''t be. Because orange is a dominant color in this photograph I would have also put the border a color to match.', '2004-08-22 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(870364, 98502, 12061, '<td valign="top">Its great when such a simple, everyday object can create such an interesting picture. I was surprised at how great this shot looked, you did an awesome job with the composition and the coloring .. Would also be a great shot for a "Shapes" theme :D</td>', 'Its great when such a simple, everyday object can create such an interesting picture. I was surprised at how great this shot looked, you did an awesome job with the composition and the coloring .. Would also be a great shot for a "Shapes" theme :D', '2004-08-22 16:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(870366, 97669, 12061, '<td valign="top">I love how the water line is completely invisible, and I also think the colors are just great. I keep getting confused when trying to set a score for this image .. something is throwing me off - its like the boat looks a tad oversharpened or something. Just my eye''s I''m sure. I''m bumping you to a 7 .. .well done :)</td>', 'I love how the water line is completely invisible, and I also think the colors are just great. I keep getting confused when trying to set a score for this image .. something is throwing me off - its like the boat looks a tad oversharpened or something. Just my eye''s I''m sure. I''m bumping you to a 7 .. .well done :)', '2004-08-22 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
