(870653, 98474, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the apartment buildings in the background to give a sense of place. Possibly a little less exposure to make the non-neon elements a bit more shadowy would be perfect.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the apartment buildings in the background to give a sense of place. Possibly a little less exposure to make the non-neon elements a bit more shadowy would be perfect.', '2004-08-22 22:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
