(870656, 98524, 12733, '<td valign="top">Lighted watch dials aren''t neon, but that''s cool. I like the shot, except for the change in color from the band on one side of the fact to the other - that looks unnatural.</td>', 'Lighted watch dials aren''t neon, but that''s cool. I like the shot, except for the change in color from the band on one side of the fact to the other - that looks unnatural.', '2004-08-22 22:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
