(870674, 98315, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting building, and I can see why you''d want to keep the light high enough so it can be seen. Unfortunately, the neon stands out less brightly. Possibly bringing the overall brightness down and increasing the contrast would make the lights stand out better.</td>', 'An interesting building, and I can see why you''d want to keep the light high enough so it can be seen. Unfortunately, the neon stands out less brightly. Possibly bringing the overall brightness down and increasing the contrast would make the lights stand out better.', '2004-08-22 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(870675, 97959, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, and the colors work well. It''s not literally neon, but it gives that bright, knock your eye out, effect.</td>', 'Interesting composition, and the colors work well. It''s not literally neon, but it gives that bright, knock your eye out, effect.', '2004-08-22 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(870677, 98509, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brillian colors and an interesting abstract. Very nice.</td>', 'Brillian colors and an interesting abstract. Very nice.', '2004-08-22 23:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(870679, 98338, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but you can hardly read the definition and the light looks more prismatic than neon.</td>', 'Nice idea, but you can hardly read the definition and the light looks more prismatic than neon.', '2004-08-22 23:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(870682, 98489, 12733, '<td valign="top">Many of the entries to this challenge show bright, neon-like colors created with sources other than neon. Of course many show actual neon. I''m sure you have some relevant connection to neon in mind, but I don''t see it in the photo. Sorry.</td>', 'Many of the entries to this challenge show bright, neon-like colors created with sources other than neon. Of course many show actual neon. I''m sure you have some relevant connection to neon in mind, but I don''t see it in the photo. Sorry.', '2004-08-22 23:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(870683, 97600, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what it is, but I like the way it glows.</td>', 'I can''t figure out what it is, but I like the way it glows.', '2004-08-22 23:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(870687, 98458, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and interesting cloth animals. Nice shot.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and interesting cloth animals. Nice shot.', '2004-08-22 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(870690, 98057, 12733, '<td valign="top">The colors are bright, but the picture seems too tight - it''s very distrubing to see so little of the bird at that particular point.</td>', 'The colors are bright, but the picture seems too tight - it''s very distrubing to see so little of the bird at that particular point.', '2004-08-22 23:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(870691, 98235, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is this three exposures on a moving sign, or is this a static sign. An interesting come-on (high marks for the designer) and a well composed and exposed picture of it.</td>', 'Is this three exposures on a moving sign, or is this a static sign. An interesting come-on (high marks for the designer) and a well composed and exposed picture of it.', '2004-08-22 23:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(870694, 98409, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting display, nicely shot.</td>', 'Interesting display, nicely shot.', '2004-08-22 23:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
