(872283, 97870, 25863, '<td valign="top">Wow! impressive neon fish picture.. nice background color contrast.</td>', 'Wow! impressive neon fish picture.. nice background color contrast.', '2004-08-23 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(872287, 98193, 25863, '<td valign="top">Neon pens, wow, cool.</td>', 'Neon pens, wow, cool.', '2004-08-23 16:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(872290, 97869, 23338, '<td valign="top">Such a strange image ... really entrancing.  Almost wants to draw you in.  Love the pattern formed by the images of the surrounding eggs and the contrast they provide to the brightness in the center.  Lots of speckles on the center egg over which you can let your eyes wander (escape holes for light within.  And, the surface texture of the surround eggs shows also.   Cool.  Great image.</td>', 'Such a strange image ... really entrancing.  Almost wants to draw you in.  Love the pattern formed by the images of the surrounding eggs and the contrast they provide to the brightness in the center.  Lots of speckles on the center egg over which you can let your eyes wander (escape holes for light within.  And, the surface texture of the surround eggs shows also.   Cool.  Great image.', '2004-08-23 16:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(872292, 98230, 25863, '<td valign="top">cool flow</td>', 'cool flow', '2004-08-23 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(872294, 97130, 25863, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2004-08-23 16:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(872303, 98487, 25863, '<td valign="top">cool drink.</td>', 'cool drink.', '2004-08-23 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(872309, 98315, 25863, '<td valign="top">A very thin premise.</td>', 'A very thin premise.', '2004-08-23 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(872310, 97600, 23338, '<td valign="top">Such a fascinating compostion.  Those drops just seem to hang there, don''t they.  The colors, the swirls, the ripples,  the contrasts - they all work together so well.  Forget any comments about lack of focus, this is an excercise about color, contrast, movements, etc.  I really enjoy watching it.</td>', 'Such a fascinating compostion.  Those drops just seem to hang there, don''t they.  The colors, the swirls, the ripples,  the contrasts - they all work together so well.  Forget any comments about lack of focus, this is an excercise about color, contrast, movements, etc.  I really enjoy watching it.', '2004-08-23 16:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(872312, 97874, 25863, '<td valign="top">muh.</td>', 'muh.', '2004-08-23 16:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(872316, 97725, 25863, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2004-08-23 16:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(872317, 98502, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is such a simple, but powerful image.  The shapes and colors complement each other greatly, and contrast nicely with the depth of the black background.  Nice image.  Only possible recommendation from this viewpoint is to blend more smoothly the transition from dark purple to pink on the left side.  There are almost some vertical bars on the left edge which show on the image as it displays on my screen.  But - it''s one of my favorites.</td>', 'This is such a simple, but powerful image.  The shapes and colors complement each other greatly, and contrast nicely with the depth of the black background.  Nice image.  Only possible recommendation from this viewpoint is to blend more smoothly the transition from dark purple to pink on the left side.  There are almost some vertical bars on the left edge which show on the image as it displays on my screen.  But - it''s one of my favorites.', '2004-08-23 16:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(872326, 98318, 23338, '<td valign="top">Oragami?  Not sure what the original material is, but the abstract image is really attractive and sort of relaxing.  Colors complement nicely and I like the black recesses for contrast.  Gives your eyes some lines to follow and isn''t really busy or "in your face" like lots of other images.</td>', 'Oragami?  Not sure what the original material is, but the abstract image is really attractive and sort of relaxing.  Colors complement nicely and I like the black recesses for contrast.  Gives your eyes some lines to follow and isn''t really busy or "in your face" like lots of other images.', '2004-08-23 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(872330, 98088, 23338, '<td valign="top">I rated it a "1" because I couldn''t find anything "neon" about it.  Nice photo otherwise.</td>', 'I rated it a "1" because I couldn''t find anything "neon" about it.  Nice photo otherwise.', '2004-08-23 16:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(872332, 98216, 25863, '<td valign="top">nah, too many nipples.</td>', 'nah, too many nipples.', '2004-08-23 16:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(872335, 98108, 23338, '<td valign="top">I rated this a "1" because I was looking for neon as a color - not as a play on words.  Cute thought, but I don''t think it fits at all.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'I rated this a "1" because I was looking for neon as a color - not as a play on words.  Cute thought, but I don''t think it fits at all.  Just my opinion.', '2004-08-23 16:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(872350, 97800, 23338, '<td valign="top">Cute eyes, but more of a "pet" picture than a "neon" picture.   Might have worked much better if cropped down to the bare essentials - both eyes and nothing else.  However, that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Cute eyes, but more of a "pet" picture than a "neon" picture.   Might have worked much better if cropped down to the bare essentials - both eyes and nothing else.  However, that''s just my opinion.', '2004-08-23 16:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(872354, 97613, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the eyes don''t appear truly "neon" and the overall subject ends up being, an owl?   Just didn''t seem to fit for me.</td>', 'Nice photo, but the eyes don''t appear truly "neon" and the overall subject ends up being, an owl?   Just didn''t seem to fit for me.', '2004-08-23 16:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(872360, 98237, 25863, '<td valign="top">nice colours</td>', 'nice colours', '2004-08-23 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(872371, 97038, 23338, '<td valign="top">"Almost" neon, and probably a nice place to visit.  But - just seemed sort of "flat" after looking at dozens and dozens of others with bright neon lights and black night backgrounds.   I''d also like more DOF.  Background seems lacking in focus.  Just my opinion.</td>', '"Almost" neon, and probably a nice place to visit.  But - just seemed sort of "flat" after looking at dozens and dozens of others with bright neon lights and black night backgrounds.   I''d also like more DOF.  Background seems lacking in focus.  Just my opinion.', '2004-08-23 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(872380, 98431, 23338, '<td valign="top">I see this all the time at Burger King or some such place.   Being an artsy kind of guy, I rated higher for abstract neon colors and lower for pretty much non-neon images and cartoons or cartoon characters.  That''s just my liking.</td>', 'I see this all the time at Burger King or some such place.   Being an artsy kind of guy, I rated higher for abstract neon colors and lower for pretty much non-neon images and cartoons or cartoon characters.  That''s just my liking.', '2004-08-23 17:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(872390, 98428, 23338, '<td valign="top">Lifelike color, slightly out of fucus, good background contrast.  I only rated it a "2" because it just didn''t grab my attention and hold it - and the neon was both weak and "a band aid?"  Might go good with a drug store ad though.  Sorry.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Lifelike color, slightly out of fucus, good background contrast.  I only rated it a "2" because it just didn''t grab my attention and hold it - and the neon was both weak and "a band aid?"  Might go good with a drug store ad though.  Sorry.  Just my opinion.', '2004-08-23 17:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(872391, 97675, 25863, '<td valign="top">not bad</td>', 'not bad', '2004-08-23 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(872393, 98270, 25863, '<td valign="top">a faint neon illumination..</td>', 'a faint neon illumination..', '2004-08-23 17:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(872397, 98511, 25863, '<td valign="top">Corporate, black void.</td>', 'Corporate, black void.', '2004-08-23 17:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(872398, 98456, 23338, '<td valign="top">Interesting plant, but my personal preferences are for less obviously out of focus backgrounds in such closeups and more contrasting overall fields of blacks or whites to offset the bright colored leaves and stamens.  I''d also try to get more of the actual plant in better focus.  But, hey, that''s just me.</td>', 'Interesting plant, but my personal preferences are for less obviously out of focus backgrounds in such closeups and more contrasting overall fields of blacks or whites to offset the bright colored leaves and stamens.  I''d also try to get more of the actual plant in better focus.  But, hey, that''s just me.', '2004-08-23 17:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(872409, 98028, 25863, '<td valign="top">nah</td>', 'nah', '2004-08-23 17:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(872415, 98314, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how much of the neon was added, especially since both the rock and the underside of the lip are about the same color, but it just didn''t look very natural to me.  And, as an overall image, it didn''t grab me and make me want to sit there and admire the neon color.  I also would have liked a plainer background without all the distracting speckles.  Sorry, but them''s just my preferences.</td>', 'I''m not sure how much of the neon was added, especially since both the rock and the underside of the lip are about the same color, but it just didn''t look very natural to me.  And, as an overall image, it didn''t grab me and make me want to sit there and admire the neon color.  I also would have liked a plainer background without all the distracting speckles.  Sorry, but them''s just my preferences.', '2004-08-23 17:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(872416, 97780, 25863, '<td valign="top">mysterious UFO siting</td>', 'mysterious UFO siting', '2004-08-23 17:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(872422, 98036, 23338, '<td valign="top">This would probably make a nice poster, but it just hit me wrong when I was rating it.  Pondering about it for awhile, I think it was because there was so much "busy" stuff in the bottom 2/3rds of the image which really wasn''t "neon" and which seemed to act to mute what neon there was in the top 1/3.  Also, I''d just seen dozens of other store fronts.</td>', 'This would probably make a nice poster, but it just hit me wrong when I was rating it.  Pondering about it for awhile, I think it was because there was so much "busy" stuff in the bottom 2/3rds of the image which really wasn''t "neon" and which seemed to act to mute what neon there was in the top 1/3.  Also, I''d just seen dozens of other store fronts.', '2004-08-23 17:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(872433, 98374, 23338, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo.  Rated it probably two or three times, raising the rating each time.  (It sort of "grows" on you.)  There''s lots to look at, the patterns of colors and swirls splashing outward from the center are very attractive and when you get done admiring it, you start to wonder: How the heck was this done?</td>', 'I really liked this photo.  Rated it probably two or three times, raising the rating each time.  (It sort of "grows" on you.)  There''s lots to look at, the patterns of colors and swirls splashing outward from the center are very attractive and when you get done admiring it, you start to wonder: How the heck was this done?', '2004-08-23 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(872436, 98383, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful abstract of nicely complimenting colors and patterns.  Good contrasts with the blacks and lines, too.  Really liked it.</td>', 'This is such a wonderful abstract of nicely complimenting colors and patterns.  Good contrasts with the blacks and lines, too.  Really liked it.', '2004-08-23 17:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(872439, 98428, 12733, '<td valign="top">Kind of bright colored, maybe, but neon it ain''t. Some of the colors that were produced with media other than neon lights really had that brilliant, blinding quality about them. Sorry, but this one doesn''t.</td>', 'Kind of bright colored, maybe, but neon it ain''t. Some of the colors that were produced with media other than neon lights really had that brilliant, blinding quality about them. Sorry, but this one doesn''t.', '2004-08-23 17:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(872440, 98518, 12733, '<td valign="top">Black light? The colors have something of the glow of neon. Nice composition, nice model.</td>', 'Black light? The colors have something of the glow of neon. Nice composition, nice model.', '2004-08-23 17:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(872443, 98534, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you got that glowing green; I don''t think it was real neon, but it has that effect. The capture and the composition are great - I like the way the tail balances the rest of the lobster.</td>', 'I don''t know how you got that glowing green; I don''t think it was real neon, but it has that effect. The capture and the composition are great - I like the way the tail balances the rest of the lobster.', '2004-08-23 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(872444, 97675, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''m always fascinated with these tunnels as I drive through them.  They have a tendency to give you vertigo: suddenly you''re driving straight down into them, or you''re upside down, about to fall off the ceiling.  You caught the lines, contrasting lights and shadows and highlighting red tail lights with reflections just right.  Neat image.</td>', 'I''m always fascinated with these tunnels as I drive through them.  They have a tendency to give you vertigo: suddenly you''re driving straight down into them, or you''re upside down, about to fall off the ceiling.  You caught the lines, contrasting lights and shadows and highlighting red tail lights with reflections just right.  Neat image.', '2004-08-23 17:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(872445, 98387, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of motion blur, and the off center composition is very dynamic.</td>', 'Nice use of motion blur, and the off center composition is very dynamic.', '2004-08-23 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(872446, 98467, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and the sense of a worn-out city neighborhood. The background is too brightly lit; it prevents the neon from standing out. Dropping the brightness with curves or levels and upping the contrast would make this a very effective shot.</td>', 'I like the textures and the sense of a worn-out city neighborhood. The background is too brightly lit; it prevents the neon from standing out. Dropping the brightness with curves or levels and upping the contrast would make this a very effective shot.', '2004-08-23 17:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(872449, 97508, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of motion blur, and brilliant colors. It wouldn''t have been much of a shot if it had simply been static with a straight alignment.</td>', 'Nice use of motion blur, and brilliant colors. It wouldn''t have been much of a shot if it had simply been static with a straight alignment.', '2004-08-23 17:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(872453, 98498, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you could have hit on a less flattering angle for a face if you had been trying. And it appears you had an attractive model to work with.</td>', 'I don''t think you could have hit on a less flattering angle for a face if you had been trying. And it appears you had an attractive model to work with.', '2004-08-23 17:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(872455, 97563, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but I have trouble picking out the neon - it can''t be a very important element in this composition.</td>', 'Interesting effect, but I have trouble picking out the neon - it can''t be a very important element in this composition.', '2004-08-23 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(872462, 98491, 12733, '<td valign="top">Not even PART of an open sign? How would we know? Seriously, though, using such a small part of the overall sign creates an interesting abstract - undoubtedly more interesting than the sign as a whole.</td>', 'Not even PART of an open sign? How would we know? Seriously, though, using such a small part of the overall sign creates an interesting abstract - undoubtedly more interesting than the sign as a whole.', '2004-08-23 17:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
