(872470, 98108, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like puns, but this is cute. If you could have found a way to have the lights on and the background darkened, this coulda been a 9 or 10.</td>', 'I don''t usually like puns, but this is cute. If you could have found a way to have the lights on and the background darkened, this coulda been a 9 or 10.', '2004-08-23 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
