(874848, 97725, 93, '<td valign="top">While I was originally going to give this photo a 6 or a 7, based on the fact that it *is* a shot of a common neon sign.. I had to stop for a minute, because I kept coming back to it..   I just have to say that I love the way you''ve framed it, and how it''s lit.  It''s a common sign.. but you''ve somehow made it simply stunning to look at.. so.. an 8 from me. :)</td>', 'While I was originally going to give this photo a 6 or a 7, based on the fact that it *is* a shot of a common neon sign.. I had to stop for a minute, because I kept coming back to it..   I just have to say that I love the way you''ve framed it, and how it''s lit.  It''s a common sign.. but you''ve somehow made it simply stunning to look at.. so.. an 8 from me. :)', '2004-08-24 20:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
