(875231, 98262, 8624, '<td valign="top">great capture, very well exposed. If you are like me, you are getting hammered by people who think signs shouldn''t be in this challenge, but they are missing out on what you have captured here. a well exposed, very sharp and interesting night shot. well done.</td>', 'great capture, very well exposed. If you are like me, you are getting hammered by people who think signs shouldn''t be in this challenge, but they are missing out on what you have captured here. a well exposed, very sharp and interesting night shot. well done.', '2004-08-24 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(875240, 98055, 8624, '<td valign="top">interesting that the last shot I had to vote on turned out to be my favorite in the challenge. I love the exposure and the colors in this image. Having the classic PT cruiser be the canvas for the neon lights of a classic diner is a great choice. only thing keeping it from a 10 for me is the bright hot spot over the "PT" - I would have cloned that out, but I realize you can''t in an open challenge. well done, and I hope you get the blue ribbon!</td>', 'interesting that the last shot I had to vote on turned out to be my favorite in the challenge. I love the exposure and the colors in this image. Having the classic PT cruiser be the canvas for the neon lights of a classic diner is a great choice. only thing keeping it from a 10 for me is the bright hot spot over the "PT" - I would have cloned that out, but I realize you can''t in an open challenge. well done, and I hope you get the blue ribbon!', '2004-08-24 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(875243, 97567, 25940, '<td valign="top">it''s not the best one you''ve done but it''s still nice. why did you kill it???</td>', 'it''s not the best one you''ve done but it''s still nice. why did you kill it???', '2004-08-24 23:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
