(875326, 97517, 22975, '<td valign="top">You''ve inspired me to try to recreate this, I have a feeling it will be more difficult than I think it will be, but will undoubtedly teach me a little more about lighting.  Great composition.</td>', 'You''ve inspired me to try to recreate this, I have a feeling it will be more difficult than I think it will be, but will undoubtedly teach me a little more about lighting.  Great composition.', '2004-08-25 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
