(875334, 98187, 18552, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colors and focus.  To my mind the most well done sign picture in the whole challenge. Did you crop the bottom off or did it just come out of the camera that way. It would have been nice to not have that little bit cropped off but might have been impossible.</td>', 'Fabulous colors and focus.  To my mind the most well done sign picture in the whole challenge. Did you crop the bottom off or did it just come out of the camera that way. It would have been nice to not have that little bit cropped off but might have been impossible.', '2004-08-25 00:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
