(875338, 98254, 18552, '<td valign="top">How lovely. Hope you wrote down how you did this on your picture as I''m really curious how it was done.</td>', 'How lovely. Hope you wrote down how you did this on your picture as I''m really curious how it was done.', '2004-08-25 00:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(875340, 98443, 2792, '<td valign="top">I think the idea and composition is great, but I think it needs to be a little bit stronger on the technical side.  Would have loved to seee the face lit up more.</td>', 'I think the idea and composition is great, but I think it needs to be a little bit stronger on the technical side.  Would have loved to seee the face lit up more.', '2004-08-25 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(875343, 97754, 22975, '<td valign="top">How in the heck did you get the dark spots so non-grainy!?!?!  I''m in awe of your technique.  I''m really learning a lot with this challenge-- thanks!</td>', 'How in the heck did you get the dark spots so non-grainy!?!?!  I''m in awe of your technique.  I''m really learning a lot with this challenge-- thanks!', '2004-08-25 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(875346, 98330, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really cool picture, the way the cross is reflected in the clouds is very unusual. To me the composition might have been improved if the cross hadn''t been so centered. The photo also has quite a bit of noise in the sky. That''s sometimes hard to avoid with night shots, perhaps some slight noise removal with a program like neat image might help.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-25 00:08:26.</i></td>', 'Really cool picture, the way the cross is reflected in the clouds is very unusual. To me the composition might have been improved if the cross hadn''t been so centered. The photo also has quite a bit of noise in the sky. That''s sometimes hard to avoid with night shots, perhaps some slight noise removal with a program like neat image might help.', '2004-08-25 00:13:23.000000', '2004-08-25 01:08:26.000000', 1),
(875348, 98345, 2792, '<td valign="top">Creepy!  I like the negative space and how the mask fades into the background.  Good job!</td>', 'Creepy!  I like the negative space and how the mask fades into the background.  Good job!', '2004-08-25 00:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(875353, 97625, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting and very certainly very neon bright! It is a bit busy. I''m very interested in how you achieved this - hope you wrote down how you did it so people can read what you did at the end of the challenge.</td>', 'This is really interesting and very certainly very neon bright! It is a bit busy. I''m very interested in how you achieved this - hope you wrote down how you did it so people can read what you did at the end of the challenge.', '2004-08-25 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(875354, 98319, 2792, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure.  It''s cropped a little too closely, would have liked to have seen a little more black space around the border.  Otherwise, nice job.  =-)</td>', 'Nice exposure.  It''s cropped a little too closely, would have liked to have seen a little more black space around the border.  Otherwise, nice job.  =-)', '2004-08-25 00:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(875358, 98109, 2792, '<td valign="top">Cool! Would like to see the neon just a hair brighter and maybe not so centered.  Other than that, nice job!</td>', 'Cool! Would like to see the neon just a hair brighter and maybe not so centered.  Other than that, nice job!', '2004-08-25 00:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(875366, 98428, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture. Your black background turned out really well and the foot is in good focus and the colors are great. It doesn''t really have a real Neon feel to it though - the bandaid is a nice bright yellow but it really isn''t the main thing that grabs your eye as you look at the photo - the foot is the main center of attention. Perhaps if you had used a neon pink or green bandaid it would have stood out more.</td>', 'Nice clear picture. Your black background turned out really well and the foot is in good focus and the colors are great. It doesn''t really have a real Neon feel to it though - the bandaid is a nice bright yellow but it really isn''t the main thing that grabs your eye as you look at the photo - the foot is the main center of attention. Perhaps if you had used a neon pink or green bandaid it would have stood out more.', '2004-08-25 00:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(875368, 98311, 2792, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Like the old time feel of this.  Good exposure!  I might have panned the camera down just a little bit, but other than that, good job.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Like the old time feel of this.  Good exposure!  I might have panned the camera down just a little bit, but other than that, good job.', '2004-08-25 00:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(875371, 98235, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great picture for the challenge. You did a wonderful job of capturing this sign!  Perhaps if you adjusted the levels a little more on the bright end it would really make the neon colors more vivid.</td>', 'Great picture for the challenge. You did a wonderful job of capturing this sign!  Perhaps if you adjusted the levels a little more on the bright end it would really make the neon colors more vivid.', '2004-08-25 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(875380, 98457, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesing neon sign. To my eyes, you might have done more with this in post processing to really make it stand out. The building reflection in the background has a lot of noise in it which is kind of distracting. I think, if you played with levels you could get the background to be darker and the sign to be brighter and really pop out at you.</td>', 'Very interesing neon sign. To my eyes, you might have done more with this in post processing to really make it stand out. The building reflection in the background has a lot of noise in it which is kind of distracting. I think, if you played with levels you could get the background to be darker and the sign to be brighter and really pop out at you.', '2004-08-25 00:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(875382, 98268, 18552, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. The composition and focus is really good. I think perhaps if you increased the saturation a bit and pulled in the levels on the light end it might make this really pop out and be fantastic.</td>', 'Excellent picture. The composition and focus is really good. I think perhaps if you increased the saturation a bit and pulled in the levels on the light end it might make this really pop out and be fantastic.', '2004-08-25 00:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(875383, 97508, 23929, '<td valign="top">Can you tell me how you did this type of border? I would love to know and am only really a novice with digital media. Great pic by the way.</td>', 'Can you tell me how you did this type of border? I would love to know and am only really a novice with digital media. Great pic by the way.', '2004-08-25 00:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(875384, 98387, 14448, '<td valign="top">Technical 3/3 - very well executed, great contrast, colour, feeling of speed conveyed by the blur<br/>Artistic 2/3 - feel like I''ve seen it before, but I appreciate the thoughtful composition<br/>Meets the competition - you bet, 3/3<br/>Emotional - 0/1 - just a personal thing, ye old fairground-at-night shot just don''t turn my crank, not your fault  :)<br/> <br/>8/10 - certainly among the cream of the crop</td>', 'Technical 3/3 - very well executed, great contrast, colour, feeling of speed conveyed by the blurArtistic 2/3 - feel like I''ve seen it before, but I appreciate the thoughtful compositionMeets the competition - you bet, 3/3Emotional - 0/1 - just a personal thing, ye old fairground-at-night shot just don''t turn my crank, not your fault  :) 8/10 - certainly among the cream of the crop', '2004-08-25 00:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(875391, 97195, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a good idea for the challenge. I would like to see how you did the lighting. The picture looks a bit tilted even though I don''t think it is as the table edge on the bottom is straight. Perhaps if you had rotated it a bit to the right and then cropped so the table edge wasn''t visible it wouldn''t look slightly out of kilter. The reflection is nice. The picture is a bit noisy, thing some noise reduction might have really make it stunning.</td>', 'What a good idea for the challenge. I would like to see how you did the lighting. The picture looks a bit tilted even though I don''t think it is as the table edge on the bottom is straight. Perhaps if you had rotated it a bit to the right and then cropped so the table edge wasn''t visible it wouldn''t look slightly out of kilter. The reflection is nice. The picture is a bit noisy, thing some noise reduction might have really make it stunning.', '2004-08-25 00:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(875392, 98319, 23929, '<td valign="top">Go the yellow borders lol. Are you getting a bagging because of the border? I personally love it and used something similar on mine but have copped heaps for it. Love this image.</td>', 'Go the yellow borders lol. Are you getting a bagging because of the border? I personally love it and used something similar on mine but have copped heaps for it. Love this image.', '2004-08-25 00:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(875402, 98311, 14448, '<td valign="top">Honestly, if I see one more store window neon sign anytime soon I''m going to hurl ... BUT, I will make a rare exception and acknowledge that I like this shot.  I buy into its ''after hours'' mood.  The repetition in the image (while not entirely your creation - the designer of the display should get much of the credit) is attractive.  Your choce of black and white adds very effective emphasis.  Good sharpness and tonal range.  Meets the challenge.  7<br/> <br/></td>', 'Honestly, if I see one more store window neon sign anytime soon I''m going to hurl ... BUT, I will make a rare exception and acknowledge that I like this shot.  I buy into its ''after hours'' mood.  The repetition in the image (while not entirely your creation - the designer of the display should get much of the credit) is attractive.  Your choce of black and white adds very effective emphasis.  Good sharpness and tonal range.  Meets the challenge.  7 ', '2004-08-25 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(875405, 98124, 23929, '<td valign="top">I love the coloured border.</td>', 'I love the coloured border.', '2004-08-25 00:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(875411, 98505, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great job on your picture. Your title is really effective, too.</td>', 'Great job on your picture. Your title is really effective, too.', '2004-08-25 00:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(875414, 98331, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is really nice, you''ve made a simple neon sign look really different and unusual and very artistic!</td>', 'Your picture is really nice, you''ve made a simple neon sign look really different and unusual and very artistic!', '2004-08-25 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(875415, 98257, 14448, '<td valign="top">I like the dark mood, the bold colour, the the strong simple composition.  It has a couple of very bothersome clangers for me though.  It is oversharpened to the degree where the resulting halos are quite distracting.  Also, it drives neurotic me crazy when there are spelling mistakes in the title.  Good job overall: 6.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the dark mood, the bold colour, the the strong simple composition.  It has a couple of very bothersome clangers for me though.  It is oversharpened to the degree where the resulting halos are quite distracting.  Also, it drives neurotic me crazy when there are spelling mistakes in the title.  Good job overall: 6.  Good luck.', '2004-08-25 00:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(875416, 98518, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really nice!  I''ll be interested to know how this effect (natural or not) was achieved.    I just took one more look and bumped this to an 8 from my previous 7</td>', 'Really nice!  I''ll be interested to know how this effect (natural or not) was achieved.    I just took one more look and bumped this to an 8 from my previous 7', '2004-08-25 00:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
