(875419, 97479, 18799, '<td valign="top">Colors are great and I like the composition - one of  my favorites   9  I took my last look and bumped you to a 10.  good job!</td>', 'Colors are great and I like the composition - one of  my favorites   9  I took my last look and bumped you to a 10.  good job!', '2004-08-25 00:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
