(875459, 97038, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting colors, nice composition.  not sure where the neon fits in, though.</td>', 'interesting colors, nice composition.  not sure where the neon fits in, though.', '2004-08-25 00:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(875460, 98055, 14448, '<td valign="top">May be the only entry of this competition that I truly, deeply admire.  A lot going on here creatively, for such a ''simple'' shot.  I love the interplay of colour &amp; form.   <br/>Technical 3/3<br/>Creative 3/3<br/>Meets the challenge 3/3<br/>Emotional 1/1 - evokes that 50''s drive-in diner feeling - expecting a girl in bobby socks to rollerskate over and take my order any second<br/>10 - well done, my only 10 of this challenge</td>', 'May be the only entry of this competition that I truly, deeply admire.  A lot going on here creatively, for such a ''simple'' shot.  I love the interplay of colour & form.   Technical 3/3Creative 3/3Meets the challenge 3/3Emotional 1/1 - evokes that 50''s drive-in diner feeling - expecting a girl in bobby socks to rollerskate over and take my order any second10 - well done, my only 10 of this challenge', '2004-08-25 00:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
