(875497, 98055, 14448, '<td valign="top">I''m just in shock that this did not do much better.  I''ve looked over the top 10, and with no disrepect whatsoever to those photographers, I still believe this is THE image of this competition.  It ain''t a ribbon, but you''ve won my admiration and respect.</td>', 'I''m just in shock that this did not do much better.  I''ve looked over the top 10, and with no disrepect whatsoever to those photographers, I still believe this is THE image of this competition.  It ain''t a ribbon, but you''ve won my admiration and respect.', '2004-08-25 01:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
