(875503, 98187, 19708, '<td valign="top">Ever get one of those shots that just comes out right<br/>except for one minor thing and wish you could re-do it?<br/>Then you go to re-shoot it and the darn thing is turned off!<br/> <br/>I couldn''t do anything about the crop and chose to submit it<br/>anyway, full know I was going to get hit hard on it!!<br/> <br/>I did re-shoot it and if you click on the Print Available,<br/>the better version is visible there.<br/> <br/>Oh so close....<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for so many comments and the votes.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-25 00:09:17.</i></td>', 'Ever get one of those shots that just comes out rightexcept for one minor thing and wish you could re-do it?Then you go to re-shoot it and the darn thing is turned off! I couldn''t do anything about the crop and chose to submit itanyway, full know I was going to get hit hard on it!! I did re-shoot it and if you click on the Print Available,the better version is visible there. Oh so close.... Thanks everyone for so many comments and the votes.', '2004-08-25 01:08:29.000000', '2004-08-25 01:09:17.000000', 0),
(875504, 98430, 12061, '<td valign="top">Your first ribbon too!! Congratulations! :D This picture is lovely</td>', 'Your first ribbon too!! Congratulations! :D This picture is lovely', '2004-08-25 01:08:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(875505, 97675, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know what you could have done to improve this.  i gave it a 10.  better luck next time.</td>', 'i don''t know what you could have done to improve this.  i gave it a 10.  better luck next time.', '2004-08-25 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
