(876370, 97780, 19841, '<td valign="top">The kitelike thing is a neon trapezoid hanging in the darkened shop. The motel is a reflection. (I flipped the photo)  I really wanted to get the feel of an old post card.<br/>I had to work hard to find just the right angle.</td>', 'The kitelike thing is a neon trapezoid hanging in the darkened shop. The motel is a reflection. (I flipped the photo)  I really wanted to get the feel of an old post card.I had to work hard to find just the right angle.', '2004-08-25 10:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(876376, 98498, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hey good showing. This is well deserving of a ribbon! Choice!!</td>', 'Hey good showing. This is well deserving of a ribbon! Choice!!', '2004-08-25 10:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(876390, 97517, 15891, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo... The composition is clean and simple. I also enjoy the lighting you used for this shot. I''m really surprised it didn''t score better - I gave you a 9 as I felt you met the challenge in a very creative way. But alas, the numbers don''t matter one wit and I certainly hope you don''t let the final score discourage you. Great shot - looking forward to seeing more great work from you.</td>', 'I really liked this photo... The composition is clean and simple. I also enjoy the lighting you used for this shot. I''m really surprised it didn''t score better - I gave you a 9 as I felt you met the challenge in a very creative way. But alas, the numbers don''t matter one wit and I certainly hope you don''t let the final score discourage you. Great shot - looking forward to seeing more great work from you.', '2004-08-25 10:17:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(876392, 98498, 5391, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote on this challenge, but am happy that this won a ribbon - well deserving, beautiful, powerful shot!  Very creative.  Congrats!</td>', 'I didn''t get to vote on this challenge, but am happy that this won a ribbon - well deserving, beautiful, powerful shot!  Very creative.  Congrats!', '2004-08-25 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(876399, 97553, 15891, '<td valign="top">It was you!<br/>I''m SO surprised this photo didn''t score better - I felt this shot was a very creative solution to the challenge. Oh well, I know you aren''t hung up on something so trivial as voting numbers but I gave you a 9 for a job well done. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'It was you!I''m SO surprised this photo didn''t score better - I felt this shot was a very creative solution to the challenge. Oh well, I know you aren''t hung up on something so trivial as voting numbers but I gave you a 9 for a job well done. Keep up the good work!', '2004-08-25 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(876406, 98514, 15891, '<td valign="top">This photo is so cool! It just screams "ART" and it is a very creative solution to the challenge. Should have scored better - I gave you an eight because at the time, the posterization in some parts of the image bothered me. But after giving it another look, if I had it to do over again I would have bumped it to a nine. Good job - looking forward to seeing more of your work. By the way, you should make a print of this available; I bet it would do well.</td>', 'This photo is so cool! It just screams "ART" and it is a very creative solution to the challenge. Should have scored better - I gave you an eight because at the time, the posterization in some parts of the image bothered me. But after giving it another look, if I had it to do over again I would have bumped it to a nine. Good job - looking forward to seeing more of your work. By the way, you should make a print of this available; I bet it would do well.', '2004-08-25 10:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(876410, 98498, 13678, '<td valign="top">Hey Scanty,<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon! I knew it was only a matter of time before you got one.<br/> <br/>Mike</td>', 'Hey Scanty, Congrats on the ribbon! I knew it was only a matter of time before you got one. Mike', '2004-08-25 10:27:43.000000', NULL, 0),
