(877630, 98430, 21083, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the votes and comments left on this picture. Seeing the other ribbon winners, I am not so sure I deserve the blue. To all of those who left comments and suggestions, I have tried to PM each of you, as I am truly grateful for any comment or suggestion you took the time to leave. I at least wanted to spend the same amount of time to acknowledge that I not only read and considered, but appreciated each thought and/or suggestion you made in regards to my photo.  <br/>Thanks again. :)<br/>Amanda</td>', 'Thank you for the votes and comments left on this picture. Seeing the other ribbon winners, I am not so sure I deserve the blue. To all of those who left comments and suggestions, I have tried to PM each of you, as I am truly grateful for any comment or suggestion you took the time to leave. I at least wanted to spend the same amount of time to acknowledge that I not only read and considered, but appreciated each thought and/or suggestion you made in regards to my photo.  Thanks again. :)Amanda', '2004-08-25 21:04:26.000000', NULL, 0),
