(879500, 97715, 24098, '<td valign="top">Ah well, my first challenge entry :P<br/> <br/>I struggled with this one, mostly because I was too focused on not just taking a picture of a neon sign, I find that taking pictures of other peoples "art" just isnt gratifying to me, I struggled to find something that had the aura of the 2nd place finisher in this contest, but came up short on time and shots :P<br/> <br/>Better luck next time I soppose</td>', 'Ah well, my first challenge entry :P I struggled with this one, mostly because I was too focused on not just taking a picture of a neon sign, I find that taking pictures of other peoples "art" just isnt gratifying to me, I struggled to find something that had the aura of the 2nd place finisher in this contest, but came up short on time and shots :P Better luck next time I soppose', '2004-08-26 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
