(880104, 97873, 25065, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by computerking:</b></div><hr/><i> Way too busy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I stand by my statement: to <b>me</b>, there was too much going on. It struck me as visually confusing from the first, which turned me off to it. As it was, it was a well-taken shot otherwise, which offset my initial reaction somewhat.</td>', 'Originally posted by computerking: Way too busy.   I stand by my statement: to me, there was too much going on. It struck me as visually confusing from the first, which turned me off to it. As it was, it was a well-taken shot otherwise, which offset my initial reaction somewhat.', '2004-08-27 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
