(880248, 98430, 9111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot from the American side!! I wondered if it was as beautiful as from the canadian side.. you showed me it is at night!!  You caught the lights in just the perfect timing as they do rotate colors every few minutes.  The light beams in the mist are awe inspiring!</td>', 'Beautiful shot from the American side!! I wondered if it was as beautiful as from the canadian side.. you showed me it is at night!!  You caught the lights in just the perfect timing as they do rotate colors every few minutes.  The light beams in the mist are awe inspiring!', '2004-08-27 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
