(882462, 98467, 25831, '<td valign="top">wow i voted a 9 on this photo. i thought it was wonderful. i love the fact that it lacked the glamour of all the other neons. It allowed me to imagine the surroundings and the people that might have been around. i think its great. all the other sign pictures lacked depth, i think you captured something very interesting.</td>', 'wow i voted a 9 on this photo. i thought it was wonderful. i love the fact that it lacked the glamour of all the other neons. It allowed me to imagine the surroundings and the people that might have been around. i think its great. all the other sign pictures lacked depth, i think you captured something very interesting.', '2004-08-29 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
