(949412, 97737, 22975, '<td valign="top">My out-take... I wish I had trusted my instinct instead of listening to a friend.  I think it would have fared better.  <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=98440" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22975/thumb/98440.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22975/thumb/98440.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22975/thumb/98440.jpg"/></a></td>', 'My out-take... I wish I had trusted my instinct instead of listening to a friend.  I think it would have fared better.   ', '2004-10-07 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
