(1021861, 98512, 8367, '<td valign="top">Almost 100 people thought this was below average. I''d love to have some feedback. My guess is "it''s boring", but I feel that it''s an above average photo and any input would be appreciated so I can improve. Thanks.</td>', 'Almost 100 people thought this was below average. I''d love to have some feedback. My guess is "it''s boring", but I feel that it''s an above average photo and any input would be appreciated so I can improve. Thanks.', '2004-11-19 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
